Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.41,0:00:36.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}荧光闪烁最大化。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lumos Maxima.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:41.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}荧光闪烁最大化。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lumos Maxima.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.81,0:01:03.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}荧光闪烁最大化。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lumos Maxima.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:07.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}荧光闪烁最大化。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lumos Maxima.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.57,0:01:11.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}荧光闪烁最大化！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lumos Maxima!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.39,0:01:42.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利。哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry. Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.64,0:01:44.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利，开门。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry, open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.52,0:01:48.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh....
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:52.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛姬。见到你真高兴——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Marge. How lovely to see--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.07,0:01:57.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗农姨父，我需要你签这份表。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uncle Vernon, I need you to sign this form.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.62,0:01:58.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.12,0:02:01.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么。学校的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing. School stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.41,0:02:04.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许待会儿吧，如果你表现好的话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Later perhaps, if you behave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.25,0:02:06.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她乖我就乖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will if she does.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.63,0:02:09.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦，你还在这儿啊？  -是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, you're still here, are you?   -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.17,0:02:12.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别用那种不知感恩的语气说“是”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't say yes in that ungrateful way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.97,0:02:14.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我弟弟肯收留你，真是仁至义尽。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn good of my brother to keep you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.09,0:02:18.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是你被丢到我门口，我早就直接送孤儿院了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He'd have been straight to an orphanage if he'd been dumped on my doorstep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.85,0:02:23.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是我的达达吗？是我的小宝贝侄子吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that my Dudders? Is that my little neffy-pooh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.14,0:02:25.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲一个。来呀。起来，起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give us a kiss. Come on. Up, up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.10,0:02:28.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把玛姬的行李箱搬到楼上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take Marge's suitcase upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.56,0:02:30.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.90,0:02:36.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}替妈妈喝完。好孩子，小里皮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Finish that off for Mommy. Good boy, Rippy-pooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.78,0:02:40.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛姬，来一点吗？就一小杯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I tempt you, Marge? Just a small one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.95,0:02:43.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}饭菜真棒，佩妮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excellent nosh, Petunia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.50,0:02:46.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再来一点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:50.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我平时就随便吃点煎食，毕竟养了十二条狗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Usually just a fry-up for me, what with 12 dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.54,0:02:53.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再来一点。好孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just a bit more. That's a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.59,0:02:58.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊！你想尝一点白兰地吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah! You wanna try a little drop of brandy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.39,0:03:02.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给小里皮皮来一小滴白兰地酒酒、甜甜香香？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A little drop of brandy-brandy windy-wandy for Rippy-pippy-pooh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.93,0:03:05.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你笑什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you smirking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.89,0:03:07.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗农，你把这孩子送哪儿了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where did you send the boy, Vernon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.94,0:03:11.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}圣布鲁特斯。那是专收无可救药孩子的名校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}St. Brutus'. It's a fine institution for hopeless cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:14.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}圣布鲁特斯用藤条打人吗，小子？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do they use a cane at St. Brutus', boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.86,0:03:19.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.41,0:03:22.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。我被揍过好多次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I've been beaten loads of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.24,0:03:24.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了。我可不要这种婆婆妈妈的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excellent. I won't have this namby-pamby...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.04,0:03:28.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……该揍的人不揍的鬼话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... wishy-washy nonsense about not beating people who deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.33,0:03:31.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这孩子变成这样，你别怪自己。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You mustn't blame yourself about how this one turned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.63,0:03:35.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这全是血统的事。坏血统总会露出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all to do with blood. Bad blood will out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.72,0:03:37.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}佩妮，这孩子的父亲是干什么的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is it the boy's father did, Petunia?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.05,0:03:41.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么都不干。他不工作。他是个无业游民。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing. He didn't work. He was unemployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.22,0:03:44.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-而且肯定还是个酒鬼？  -胡说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-And a drunk too, no doubt?   -That's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.22,0:03:46.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你说什么？  -我爸爸不是酒鬼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What did you say?   -My dad wasn't a drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.77,0:03:53.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心。别大惊小怪，佩妮。我抓得很牢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry. Don't fuss, Petunia. I have a very firm grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.02,0:03:55.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看你该去睡觉了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think it's time you went to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.03,0:03:59.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闭嘴，弗农。你，擦干净。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quiet, Vernon. You, clean it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:03.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实，这跟父亲没关系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, it's nothing to do with the father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.87,0:04:07.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全跟母亲有关。养狗就常看到这种事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all to do with the mother. You see it all the time with dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.79,0:04:11.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}母狗有问题，小狗就有问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If something's wrong with the bitch, then something's wrong with the pup.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.04,0:04:13.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闭嘴！闭嘴！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shut up! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.72,0:04:22.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。我告诉你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. Let me tell you....
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.15,0:04:38.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh....
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:46.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗农！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Vernon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.37,0:04:51.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗农！弗农，快想想办法！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Vernon! Vernon, do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.46,0:04:56.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎哟！里皮！哎哟……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ow! Ripper! Ow....
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.63,0:05:36.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停下！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.21,0:05:41.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我抓住你了，玛姬。我抓住你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've got you, Marge. I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.22,0:05:47.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坚持住，坚持住。放开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold on, hold on. Get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.47,0:05:50.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你敢！  -对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Don't you dare! Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.48,0:05:53.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，弗农。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Vernon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.48,0:05:55.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.40,0:05:57.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛姬！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Marge!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.24,0:06:06.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求你了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.08,0:06:09.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛姬！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Marge!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.37,0:06:13.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.52,0:06:39.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把她弄回来！你现在就把她弄回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You bring her back! You bring her back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.11,0:06:42.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你把她恢复原样！  -不。她活该。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You put her right!   -No. She deserved what she got.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:46.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-离我远点。  -你在校外不能施魔法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Keep away from me.   -You can't do magic outside school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.16,0:06:50.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是吗？试试看。  -他们不会让你回去了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah? Try me.   -They won't let you back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:51.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没地方可去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've nowhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.83,0:06:54.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不在乎。哪儿都比这儿强。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't care. Anywhere is better than here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.30,0:08:32.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“欢迎乘坐骑士公共汽车……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Welcome to the Knight Bus...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.30,0:08:35.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……为受困巫师提供的紧急交通工具。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...emergency transport for the stranded witch or wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.85,0:08:40.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我叫斯坦·桑帕克，今晚由我担任你们的售票员。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My name is Stan Shunpike, and I will be your conductor for this evening."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.57,0:08:45.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在下面干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What you doing down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.74,0:08:48.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我摔倒了。  -你怎么会摔倒？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I fell over.   -What you fall over for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.11,0:08:51.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我不是故意的。  -那就快上来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I didn't do it on purpose.   -Well, come on, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.99,0:08:54.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别磨蹭了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's not wait for the grass to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.29,0:09:04.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你看什么看？  -没什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What you looking at?   -Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.50,0:09:06.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就快上来。进去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, come on, then. In.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.42,0:09:09.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不不。我来拿这个。你上去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no. I'll get this. You get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.43,0:09:16.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.32,0:09:29.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走。让开，让开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Move on, move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.83,0:09:47.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开走吧，厄尼。 -对，开走，厄尼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Take her away, Ern.   -Yeah, take it away, Ernie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.25,0:09:49.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这会是一趟颠簸的旅程。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's going to be a bumpy ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.18,0:10:03.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你说你叫什么名字？  -我没说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What did you say your name was?   -I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.06,0:10:08.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你要去哪儿？  -破釜酒吧。在伦敦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Whereabouts are you headed?   -The Leaky Cauldron. That's in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.36,0:10:11.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你听见没？“破釜酒吧。在伦敦。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You hear that? "The Leaky Cauldron. That's in London."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.44,0:10:13.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}破釜酒吧。要是你那儿有豌豆汤……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Leaky Cauldron. If you have pea soup...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.95,0:10:16.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……千万要赶在它吃你之前吃掉它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...make sure you eat it before it eats you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.16,0:10:22.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些麻瓜。他们看不见我们吗？麻瓜？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Muggles. Can't they see us? Muggles?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:24.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们什么都看不见，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They don't see nothing, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.87,0:10:27.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你用叉子戳他们，他们还是有感觉的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you jab them with a fork, they feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.17,0:10:32.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}厄尼，十二点方向有个小老太太！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ernie, little old lady at 12 o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.97,0:10:43.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}十、九、八……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ten, nine, eight...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.73,0:10:46.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……七、六、五……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}.. seven, Six, five...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.65,0:10:48.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……四、三、三点五……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... four, three, three and a half...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.11,0:10:50.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……二、一又四分之三。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...two, one and three quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:53.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.41,0:10:59.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是谁？那个人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who is that? That man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.04,0:11:04.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.04,0:11:06.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是谁——？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who is--?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.75,0:11:09.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就是小天狼星·布莱克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is Sirius Black, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.71,0:11:12.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别告诉我你从没听说过小天狼星·布莱克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't tell me you've never been hearing of Sirius Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.26,0:11:16.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是个杀人犯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.72,0:11:19.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就因为这个被关进了阿兹卡班。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got himself locked up in Azkaban for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.01,0:11:23.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他怎么逃出来的？  -这正是问题所在，不是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-How did he escape?   -Well, that's the question, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.60,0:11:25.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是第一个做到的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's the first one that done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.52,0:11:29.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他曾经是……的忠实拥护者……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was a big supporter of...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.65,0:11:31.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……神秘人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...You-Know-Who.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.86,0:11:33.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜你听说过他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I reckon you've heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.90,0:11:35.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.65,0:11:36.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他我倒是听说过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Him I've heard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.66,0:11:42.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}厄尼，十二点方向有两辆双层巴士。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ernie, two double-deckers at 12 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.83,0:11:44.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它们越来越近了，厄尼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're getting closer, Ernie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.29,0:11:47.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}厄尼，它们就在我们头顶上！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ernie, they're right on top of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.92,0:11:57.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小心头。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mind your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.22,0:12:05.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，伙计们？伙计们？怎么都拉着脸？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, guys? Guys? Why the long faces?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.40,0:12:14.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了好了，快到了，快到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, yeah. Nearly there. Nearly there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.28,0:12:21.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}破釜酒吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Leaky Cauldron.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.82,0:12:23.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下一站，翻倒巷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Next stop, Knockturn Alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.87,0:12:27.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊，波特先生，终于到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah. Mr. Potter, at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.67,0:12:33.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧，厄尼，走吧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take it away, Ern. Take it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.57,0:12:58.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}十一号房。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Room 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.99,0:13:02.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海德薇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hedwig.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:05.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这只鸟可真聪明，波特先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right smart bird you got there, Mr. Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.49,0:13:08.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它比你早到五分钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He arrived here just five minutes before yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.12,0:13:14.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}作为魔法部部长，我有责任通知你，波特先生……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As Minister for Magic, it is my duty to inform you, Mr. Potter...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.92,0:13:18.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……今晚早些时候，你姨父的妹妹被人发现……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..earlier this evening your uncle's sister was located...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.30,0:13:22.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……在谢菲尔德以南一点，绕着一根烟囱打转。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...a little south of Sheffield, circling a chimney stack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.43,0:13:26.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}意外魔法逆转部立刻出动了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Accidental Magic Reversal Department was dispatched immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.35,0:13:31.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她被妥善地泄了气，记忆也做了修改。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She has been properly punctured and her memory modified.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.35,0:13:36.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她对这件事不会有任何记忆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She will have no recollection of the incident whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.19,0:13:38.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就这样了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So that's that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.94,0:13:41.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……没有造成什么伤害。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and no harm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.49,0:13:43.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}豌豆汤？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pea soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.99,0:13:46.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用了，谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.28,0:13:48.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-部长？  -什么事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Minister?   -Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.66,0:13:50.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我不明白。  -不明白？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I don't understand.   -Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.62,0:13:54.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我犯了法。未成年巫师不能在家里使用魔法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I broke the law. Underage wizards can't use magic at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.38,0:13:57.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得了吧。魔法部不会把人送进阿兹卡班……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come now. The Ministry doesn't send people to Azkaban...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.54,0:13:59.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……就因为把姑妈吹胀了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...for blowing up their aunts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.05,0:14:08.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过话说回来，在这种形势下那样跑出来……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On the other hand, running away like that, given the state of things...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.76,0:14:11.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……是非常非常不负责任的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...WaS very, very irresponsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.43,0:14:15.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-“形势”，先生？  -有个杀人犯在逃。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-"The state of things," sir?   -We have a killer on the loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.40,0:14:17.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}您是说小天狼星·布莱克？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sirius Black, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.40,0:14:19.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可他跟我有什么关系？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But what's he got to do with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.44,0:14:26.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然没关系。你很安全，这才是最重要的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing, of course. You're safe. And that's what matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.49,0:14:29.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明天你就启程回霍格沃茨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And tomorrow you'll be on your way back to Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.79,0:14:32.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是你的新课本。我自作主张……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These are your new schoolbooks. I took the liberty...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.91,0:14:36.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……让人送了过来。现在汤姆会带你去你的房间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...of having them brought here. Now Tom will show you to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.71,0:14:43.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海德薇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hedwig.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.38,0:14:48.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，顺便说一句，哈利。你在这儿的时候，最好别……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, by the way, Harry. Whilst you're here, it would be best if you didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.60,0:14:50.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……到处乱走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...wander.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:55.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了！你到底挪不挪那辆巴士？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right! You gonna move that bus or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.31,0:16:16.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}客房服务。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Housekeeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.77,0:16:22.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我晚点再来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll come back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.61,0:16:31.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我警告你，赫敏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm warning you, Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.20,0:16:34.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让那畜生离斑斑远点，不然我把它变成茶壶套。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep that beast away from Scabbers, or I'll turn it into a tea cozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.08,0:16:37.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它是只猫，罗纳德。你还指望什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a cat, Ronald. What do you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.41,0:16:40.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这是它的天性。  -猫？他们就这么告诉你的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's in his nature.   -A cat? Is that what they told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.50,0:16:43.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-看起来像只长毛的猪。这话说得真好笑……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Looks like a pig with hair. That's rich...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.21,0:16:45.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……还是从那只臭烘烘旧鞋刷的主人嘴里说出来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...coming from the owner of that smelly old shoe brush.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.92,0:16:48.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}克鲁克山，别理这个坏小子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Crookshanks, just ignore the mean little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.55,0:16:50.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.22,0:16:52.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.80,0:16:56.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-埃及什么样？  -棒极了。好多古老的东西……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Egypt. What's it like?   -Brilliant. Loads of old stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.10,0:17:00.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……像木乃伊、陵墓，连斑斑都玩得很开心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...like mummies, tombs, even Scabbers enjoyed himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.64,0:17:03.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-埃及人以前崇拜猫。  -还崇拜屎壳郎。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Egyptians used to worship cats.   -Along with the dung beetle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.98,0:17:07.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你又在显摆那张剪报了？  -我没给任何人看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Not flashing that clipping again?   -I haven't shown anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.32,0:17:09.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，一个人也没有。除非你把汤姆也算上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, not a soul. Not unless you count Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:11.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-白班女佣。  -夜班女佣。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-The day maid.   -Night maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.57,0:17:13.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-厨师。  -修马桶那家伙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Cook.   -The bloke who fixed the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:15.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哈利。  -韦斯莱夫人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Harry. Mrs. Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.62,0:17:17.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-见到你真好，亲爱的。  -见到你真好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Good to see you, dear.   -Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.70,0:17:19.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-东西都带齐了？  -带齐了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Got everything?   -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.20,0:17:21.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-带齐了？所有的书？  -都在楼上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes? All your books?   -It's all upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.54,0:17:22.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-衣服呢？  -全都带齐了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Your clothes?   -Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.12,0:17:24.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好孩子。  -谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Good boy.   -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:26.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哈利·波特。  -韦斯莱先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Harry Potter. Mr. Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.75,0:17:30.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哈利，我能跟你说句话吗？  -当然可以。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Harry, wonder if I might have a word?   -Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.47,0:17:33.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赫敏。早上好，韦斯莱先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hermione. Good morning, Mr. Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.26,0:17:36.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-期待新学期吗？  -期待，一定会很棒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Looking forward to a new term?   -Yeah. It should be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.98,0:17:43.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利，部里有些人强烈反对我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry, some within the Ministry would strongly discourage me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.98,0:17:46.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……向你透露我接下来要说的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...from divulging what I'm about to reveal to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.82,0:17:50.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我认为你需要知道真相。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I think that you need to know the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.32,0:17:52.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有危险。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.57,0:17:56.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}极其危险。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.53,0:17:59.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这跟小天狼星·布莱克有关吗，先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Has this anything to do with Sirius Black, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.00,0:18:02.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你对小天狼星·布莱克了解多少，哈利？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you know about Sirius Black, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.54,0:18:06.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-只知道他从阿兹卡班逃了出来。  -你知道为什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Only that he's escaped from Azkaban.   -Do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.96,0:18:09.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}十三年前，当你阻止了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thirteen years ago, when you stopped....
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:11.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-伏地魔。  -别说他的名字。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Voldemort.   -Don't say his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.92,0:18:13.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.43,0:18:16.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当你阻止了神秘人之后……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When you stopped You-Know-Who...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.51,0:18:18.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……布莱克失去了一切。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Black lost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.31,0:18:22.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但直到今天，他仍然是忠实的仆人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But to this day, he still remains a faithful servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.77,0:18:24.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而在他心里……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And in his mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.10,0:18:28.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你是唯一挡在他路上的障碍……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...you are the only thing that stands in the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.27,0:18:32.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……神秘人重新掌权。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...of You-Know-Who returning to power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.19,0:18:34.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that is why...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.53,0:18:37.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……他才从阿兹卡班逃了出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...he has escaped from Azkaban.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.41,0:18:39.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来找你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.58,0:18:42.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后杀了我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.16,0:18:45.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利，向我发誓，不管你听到什么……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry, swear to me that whatever you might hear...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.00,0:18:48.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你都不会去找布莱克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...you won't go looking for Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.92,0:18:50.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}韦斯莱先生……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Weasley...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.42,0:18:54.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我为什么要去找一个想杀我的人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...why would I go looking for someone who wants to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.22,0:18:56.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快。快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quick. Quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.14,0:18:58.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗恩，罗恩！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ron, Ron!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.68,0:19:01.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，真是的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, for goodness' sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.97,0:19:04.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别跟丢了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't lose him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.48,0:19:07.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是故意把她吹胀的。我只是——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't mean to blow her up. I just--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.73,0:19:10.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}——我失控了。真棒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I lost control. Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.36,0:19:13.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说真的，这不好笑。哈利没被开除算走运了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honestly, it's not funny. Harry was lucky not to be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.11,0:19:15.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没被抓起来算走运了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was lucky not to be arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.03,0:19:18.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还是觉得太厉害了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I still think it was brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.66,0:19:20.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，别的地方都满了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Everywhere else is full.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.83,0:19:25.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得那是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who do you think that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.37,0:19:28.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}R.J.卢平教授。你什么都知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Professor R.J. Lupin. Do you know everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.42,0:19:30.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她怎么什么都知道？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How is it she knows everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.71,0:19:33.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—他箱子上写着呢，罗纳德。  -—哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's on his suitcase, Ronald.   -Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:37.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得他真的睡着了吗？——好像是。怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Do you think he's really asleep?   -Seems to be. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.14,0:19:41.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得跟你说件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I gotta tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.48,0:19:57.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我理清楚一下。小天狼星·布莱克从阿兹卡班逃了出来……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me get this straight. Sirius Black escaped from Azkaban...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.99,0:19:59.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……是为了来找你？——对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-...to come after you? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.99,0:20:01.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但他们会抓住布莱克的，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But they'll catch Black, won't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.16,0:20:04.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—我是说，所有人都在找他。  -—当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I mean, everyone's looking for him.   -Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.04,0:20:08.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只不过从来没有人从阿兹卡班逃出来过……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Except no one's ever broken out of Azkaban before...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.54,0:20:12.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……而且他是个杀人狂、疯子。——谢了，罗恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-...and he's a murderous, raving lunatic.   -Thanks, Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.00,0:20:15.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们怎么停了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why are we stopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.67,0:20:18.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们还没到啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We can't be there yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.68,0:20:24.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.10,0:20:27.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道。也许车坏了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. Maybe we've broken down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.69,0:20:32.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎哟，罗恩，那是我的脚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ouch, Ron. That was my foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.90,0:20:34.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外面有东西在动。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's something moving out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.41,0:20:51.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好像有人上车了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think someone's coming aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.65,0:21:19.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死！怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bloody hell! What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.81,0:22:33.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.31,0:22:36.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利，你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.32,0:22:43.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.16,0:22:47.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来，吃了这个，会有用的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here, eat this. It'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.12,0:22:50.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事的，是巧克力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all right. It's chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.54,0:22:58.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刚才进来的那个东西是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What was that thing that came?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.79,0:23:02.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是摄魂怪，阿兹卡班的守卫之一。它已经走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was a dementor. One of the guards of Azkaban. It's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.38,0:23:05.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它在车上搜捕小天狼星·布莱克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was searching the train for Sirius Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.26,0:23:08.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恕我失陪，我得去跟司机说几句话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you'll excuse me, I need to have a little word with the driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.48,0:23:16.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吃吧，你会好受些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Eat. You'll feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.19,0:23:23.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.69,0:23:25.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有点僵住了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you sort of went rigid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.61,0:23:28.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们还以为你抽风了还是怎么的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We thought maybe you were having a fit or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.53,0:23:32.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们俩有没有……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And did either of you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.49,0:23:33.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……那个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.00,0:23:37.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……晕过去？——没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-...ass out?   -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.25,0:23:38.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过我感觉得很怪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I felt weird, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.13,0:23:40.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好像我再也不会开心了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like I'd never be cheerful again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.21,0:23:44.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是有人在尖叫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But someone was screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.59,0:23:45.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个女人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.93,0:23:48.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有人尖叫，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No one was screaming, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.11,0:24:51.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎！欢迎来到霍格沃茨的新一年。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome! Welcome to another year at Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.07,0:24:54.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，我想说几句话……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, I'd like to say a few words...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.28,0:24:58.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……趁我们还没被这顿丰盛的晚餐弄得太迷糊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...before we all become too befuddled by our excellent feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.79,0:25:02.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}首先，我很高兴欢迎R.J.卢平教授……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}First, I'm pleased to welcome Professor R.J. Lupin...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.25,0:25:04.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……他欣然同意担任……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...who's kindly consented to fill the post...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.88,0:25:07.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……黑魔法防御术课教师。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...of Defense Against the Dark Arts teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.51,0:25:10.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}祝你好运，教授。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good luck, professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.64,0:25:17.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。所以他才懂得给你巧克力，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course. That's why he knew to give you the chocolate, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.64,0:25:20.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}波特。波特。你真的晕倒了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Potter. Potter. Is it true you fainted?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.64,0:25:24.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—我是说，你真的晕过去了？  -—滚开，马尔福。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I mean, you actually fainted?   -Shove off, Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.82,0:25:26.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他怎么知道的？——算了吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-How did he find out?   -Just forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.98,0:25:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的保护神奇生物课老师……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our Care of Magical Creatures teacher...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.57,0:25:31.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……决定退休了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...nas decided to retire...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.61,0:25:35.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……好花更多时间陪他剩下的肢体。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...IN order to spend more time with his remaining limbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.58,0:25:38.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}幸运的是，我很高兴地宣布……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fortunately, I'm delighted to announce...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.45,0:25:41.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……接替他的人不是别人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that his place will be taken by none other...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.46,0:25:45.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……正是我们的鲁伯·海格。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...than our own Rubeus Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.06,0:25:59.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最后，说一件更令人不安的事……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Finally, on a more disquieting note...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.06,0:26:02.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……应魔法部的要求……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...at the request of the Ministry of Magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.77,0:26:07.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……在另行通知之前，霍格沃茨将接待阿兹卡班的摄魂怪……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... Hogwarts will, until further notice, play host to the dementors of Azkaban...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.61,0:26:11.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……直到小天狼星·布莱克被抓获为止。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...until such a time as Sirius Black is captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.03,0:26:16.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}摄魂怪将驻守在校园的每个入口。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The dementors will be stationed at every entrance to the grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.87,0:26:18.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}虽然有人向我保证……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now whilst I've been assured...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.70,0:26:22.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……它们的出现不会影响我们的日常活动……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that their presence will not disrupt our day-to-day activities...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.54,0:26:23.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……但我要提醒一句。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...a word of caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.08,0:26:27.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}摄魂怪是凶残的生物。它们不会区分……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dementors are vicious creatures. They'll not distinguish...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.42,0:26:30.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……他们要追捕的人和挡路的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...between the one they hunt and the one who gets in their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.01,0:26:34.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因此，我必须警告你们每一个人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Therefore, I must warn each and every one of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.80,0:26:38.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……不要给它们伤害你的理由。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...to give them no reason to harm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.18,0:26:44.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}摄魂怪的天性里没有宽恕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is not in the nature of a dementor to be forgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.44,0:26:49.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但要知道，幸福是可以找到的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But you know, happiness can be found...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.90,0:26:53.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……即使在最黑暗的时刻……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...even in the darkest of times...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.74,0:26:58.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……只要你记得开灯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...lf one only remembers to turn on the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.63,0:27:12.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}福图纳·马约尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fortuna Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.47,0:27:18.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来，听着。她就是不肯让我进去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here, listen. She just won't let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.34,0:27:21.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—福图纳·马约尔。  -—不不，等等，等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Fortuna Major.   -No, no. Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.43,0:27:23.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.03,0:27:38.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—真神奇，光凭我的声音就行。  -—福图纳·马约尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Amazing. Just with my voice.   -Fortuna Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.20,0:27:42.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—好，行了，进去吧。  -—谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes, all right. Go in.   -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.75,0:27:46.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三年了还是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Still doing that after three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.92,0:27:49.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-她连唱歌都不会。  -可不是嘛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-She can't even sing. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.29,0:27:51.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，伙计。嘿，伙计。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, man. Hey, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.09,0:27:54.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，天啊。太糟糕了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, God. That's awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.84,0:27:57.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}绿色的。那是只猴子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Green. That's a monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.80,0:28:02.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是什么？你管那叫猴子？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is that? You call that a monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.64,0:28:04.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别再给他了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do not give him one again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.02,0:28:07.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，纳威，试试大象。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Neville, try an elephant.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.74,0:28:16.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-罗恩，接住。  -我接着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ron, catch. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.16,0:28:23.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看我们有赢家了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think we have a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.74,0:28:27.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦，别试那种。哦，不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, don't try one of them. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.71,0:28:30.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看他。看他的脸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at him. His face.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.84,0:29:16.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎，我的孩子们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome, my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.30,0:29:21.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这间屋子里，你们将探索高贵的占卜艺术。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In this room, you shall explore the noble art of Divination.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.55,0:29:26.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这间屋子里，你们将发现自己是否拥有天目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In this room, you shall discover if you possess the Sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.27,0:29:32.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们好。我是特里劳妮教授。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello. I am Professor Trelawney.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.40,0:29:37.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们将一起把自己投向未来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Together we shall cast ourselves into the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.23,0:29:41.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这学期，我们专注于茶占术，也就是解读茶叶的艺术。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This term, we'll focus on Tasseomancy, the art of reading tea leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.24,0:29:44.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，请拿起坐在对面那位同学的茶杯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So please, take the cup of the person sitting opposite you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.32,0:29:46.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看到了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.87,0:29:52.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真相就像书页深处埋着的一句话，等待被读出。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The truth lies buried like a sentence deep within a book, waiting to be read.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.75,0:29:55.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但首先，你们必须开阔自己的心灵。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But first, you must broaden your minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.34,0:29:59.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-首先，你们必须看得更远。  -真是一派胡言。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-First, you must look beyond.   -What a load of rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.05,0:30:01.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你从哪儿冒出来的？  -我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Where did you come from?   -Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.13,0:30:04.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我一直都在这儿。  -你，孩子……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I've been here all this time.   -You, boy....
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.97,0:30:07.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你奶奶身体还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is your grandmother quite well?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.93,0:30:09.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想是吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.56,0:30:12.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可不敢这么肯定。把杯子给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wouldn't be so sure of that. Give me the cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.36,0:30:16.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真可惜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.94,0:30:19.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开阔你们的心灵。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Broaden your minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.16,0:30:26.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的气场在跳动，亲爱的。你在通灵吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your aura is pulsing, dear. Are you in the beyond?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.66,0:30:28.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我觉得你在。  -当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I think you are.   -Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.78,0:30:31.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看杯子。告诉我你看到了什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at the cup. Tell me what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.16,0:30:33.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。呃，那个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.71,0:30:38.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利这儿有个歪歪扭扭的十字。那代表磨难和痛苦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry's got sort of a wonky cross. That's trials and suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.59,0:30:42.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那边那个可能是太阳，代表幸福。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that there could be the sun and that's happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.42,0:30:43.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.92,0:30:47.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你会受苦，但你会为此感到高兴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...you're gonna suffer, but you're gonna be happy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.18,0:30:49.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把杯子给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me the cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.10,0:30:53.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我亲爱的孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my dear boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.06,0:30:57.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我亲爱的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My dear...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.40,0:31:02.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你遇上了不祥。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...you have the Grim.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.32,0:31:05.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}格林？什么是格林？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Grin? What's the Grin?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.24,0:31:08.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是格林，你这白痴。是不祥。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not the Grin, you idiot. The Grim.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.28,0:31:10.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“化作一只巨大的幽灵犬。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Taking form of a giant spectral dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.66,0:31:13.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它是我们这个世界最黑暗的预兆之一。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's among the darkest omens in our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.66,0:31:15.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's an omen...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.50,0:31:17.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……死亡的预兆。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...of death."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.84,0:31:25.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得那个不祥跟小天狼星·布莱克有关系吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't think that Grim thing's got anything to do with Sirius Black?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.84,0:31:29.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，罗恩。要我说，占卜是门含糊其辞的学科。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honestly, Ron. If you ask me, Divination's a woolly discipline.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.97,0:31:33.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}古代魔文就不一样了，那才是迷人的科目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, Ancient Runes, that's a fascinating subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.81,0:31:36.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}古代魔文？你到底选了多少门课？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ancient Runes? Exactly how many classes are you taking?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.10,0:31:38.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好几门吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A fair few.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.94,0:31:41.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。那不可能。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hang on. That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.19,0:31:43.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}古代魔文和占卜课是同一时间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ancient Runes is in the same time as Divination.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.15,0:31:46.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得同时上两门课。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have to be in two classes at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.32,0:31:49.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别傻了。人怎么可能同时上两门课？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't be silly. How could anyone be in two classes at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.87,0:31:53.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“开阔心灵。用你的内视之眼看见未来。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Broaden your minds. Use your Inner Eye to see the future."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.29,0:31:59.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这样。来吧，靠近点。不介意的话，少说几句。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's it. Come on, now. Come closer. Less talking, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.42,0:32:01.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天我给你们准备了大惊喜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got a real treat for you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.42,0:32:03.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一堂精彩的课。跟我来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A great lesson. So follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.68,0:32:17.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，你们这群人。少闲聊。到那边围成一群。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right, you lot. Less chattering. Form a group over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.94,0:32:20.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把书翻到第49页。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And open your books to page 49.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.60,0:32:22.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们到底该怎么翻？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Exactly how do we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.44,0:32:26.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然是摸摸书脊。天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just stroke the spine, of course. Goodness me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.70,0:32:39.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别这么胆小。-我没事。没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Don't be such a wimp.   -I'm okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.17,0:32:46.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我觉得它们挺好玩。  -哦，是啊。好玩得要命。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I think they're funny. Oh, yeah. Terribly funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.59,0:32:49.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真机智。天啊，这地方真是一落千丈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Witty. God, this place has gone to the dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.26,0:32:52.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等我父亲听说邓布利多让这个蠢货来教书。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait until Father hears Dumbledore's got this oaf teaching classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.89,0:32:55.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闭嘴，马尔福。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shut up, Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.02,0:32:59.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh....
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.95,0:33:12.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}摄魂怪！摄魂怪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dementor! Dementor!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.79,0:33:22.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别理他。你应该抚摸它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just ignore him. You're supposed to stroke it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.04,0:33:24.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.38,0:33:29.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗒嗒哒哒！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tah-tah-dah-dah!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.72,0:33:37.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是不是很漂亮？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Isn't he beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.89,0:33:40.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟巴克比克打个招呼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Say hello to Buckbeak.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.10,0:33:43.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海格，那到底是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hagrid, exactly what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.56,0:33:45.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗恩，那是鹰头马身有翼兽。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That, Ron, is a hippogriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.77,0:33:49.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}首先你们要知道，它们是非常高傲的生物。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}First thing you wanna know is they're very proud creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.49,0:33:53.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很容易被冒犯。千万别侮辱一只鹰头马身有翼兽。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very easily offended. You do not want to insult a hippogriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.53,0:33:56.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那可能是你这辈子做的最后一件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It may be the last thing you ever do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.45,0:33:59.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，谁想来打个招呼？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, who'd like to come and say hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.37,0:34:04.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得好，哈利。干得好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well done, Harry. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.25,0:34:08.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.17,0:34:10.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.72,0:34:14.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你得让他先动。这样才有礼貌。所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...you have to let him make the first move. It's only polite. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.59,0:34:16.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……走上前。好好给他鞠个躬。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...step up. Give him a nice bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.68,0:34:19.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后你等着，看他会不会回礼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then you wait and see if he bows back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.27,0:34:21.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果他回礼了，你就可以过去摸他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If he does, you can go and touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.56,0:34:24.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果没有——嗯，那个我们待会儿再说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If not-- Well, we'll get to that later.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.44,0:34:29.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先鞠个躬吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just make your bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.07,0:34:32.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鞠得低一点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice and low.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.08,0:34:39.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后，哈利。退后。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Back off, Harry. Back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.62,0:34:43.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别动。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep still.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.79,0:34:46.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别动。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep still.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.51,0:34:59.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，干得好，哈利。干得好。来，你这大块头。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, well done, Harry. Well done. Here, you big brute, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.89,0:35:04.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。我想你现在可以过去拍拍他了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. I think you can go and pat him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.64,0:35:06.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去吧。别害羞。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on. Don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.73,0:35:11.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎哟！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.90,0:35:17.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}慢慢来。慢慢来。慢点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice and slow, now. Nice and slow. Slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.70,0:35:22.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别急，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not so fast, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.21,0:35:30.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}慢点，哈利。就这样……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Slow down, Harry. That's it...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.67,0:35:33.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}慢慢来。让它自己靠近你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice and slow. Now let him come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.72,0:35:38.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}慢慢地，慢慢地……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Slowly, now, slowly, slowly...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.26,0:35:40.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这样……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's it...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.68,0:35:42.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.60,0:35:46.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得好！干得好，哈利，干得好！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well done! Well done, Harry, well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.19,0:35:48.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它能飞吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Does he get to fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.40,0:35:50.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它现在也许肯让你骑它了。-什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He may let you ride him now.   -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.98,0:35:53.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-来吧。嘿，嘿，嘿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come on. Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.28,0:35:55.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把你放到这儿，就在翅膀关节后面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put you over here, just behind the wing joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.53,0:36:00.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别拔它的羽毛，它可不会为此感谢你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't pull out any of his feathers, because he won't thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.42,0:36:09.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.10,0:37:06.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈！呼——！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ha! Whoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.84,0:37:45.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得好，哈利，还有你，巴克比克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well done, Harry, and well done, Buckbeak.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.55,0:37:47.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太酷了，哈利！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was wicked, Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.68,0:37:49.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，得了吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.85,0:37:52.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得好，干得好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well done, well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.85,0:37:56.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我第一天表现怎么样？  -非常棒，教授。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-How am I doing me first day?   -Brilliant, professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.49,0:38:03.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一点都不危险，对吧，你这丑陋的大畜生！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not dangerous at all, are you, you great ugly brute!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.91,0:38:04.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马尔福，别……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Malfoy, no....
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.33,0:38:08.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别！-哎哟！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No!   -Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.37,0:38:10.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}巴克比克！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Buckbeak!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.20,0:38:12.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，等等，等等……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa, whoa, whoa....
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.50,0:38:15.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停下！巴克比克！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa! Buckbeak!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.42,0:38:18.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走开，你这蠢东西……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Away, you silly creature....
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.96,0:38:22.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-它把我杀了！它把我杀了！  -冷静，只是擦伤！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's killed me! It's killed me!   -Calm down. It's just a scratch!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.26,0:38:23.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海格！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hagrid!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.64,0:38:27.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-得送他去医院。  -我是老师，我来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He has to be taken to the hospital.   -I'm the teacher. I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.89,0:38:34.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会后悔的。-下课！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You're gonna regret this.   -Class dismissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.94,0:38:37.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你和你的该死的鸡！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You and your bloody chicken!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.71,0:39:02.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很疼吗，德拉科？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Does it hurt terribly, Draco?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.97,0:39:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一阵一阵的。不过，我觉得自己还算幸运。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It comes and it goes. Still, I consider myself lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.97,0:39:10.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}庞弗雷夫人说再晚一分钟，我的胳膊就保不住了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Madam Pomfrey said another minute and I could've lost my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.64,0:39:13.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我好几周都不能写作业了。  -听听这白痴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I can't do homework for weeks.   -Listen to the idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.77,0:39:18.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他真是演得过火了，对吧？  -至少海格没被开除。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He's really laying it on thick, isn't he?   -At least Hagrid didn't get fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.23,0:39:21.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听说德拉科的父亲气坏了。这事还没完呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hear Draco's father's furious. We haven't heard the end of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.15,0:39:23.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人看见他了！-谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's been sighted! Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.20,0:39:25.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小天狼星布莱克！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sirius Black!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.95,0:39:29.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达夫敦？离这儿不远。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dufftown? That's not far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.37,0:39:33.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得他不会来霍格沃茨吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't think he'd come to Hogwarts, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.16,0:39:35.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每个入口都有摄魂怪？-摄魂怪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-With dementors at every entrance?   -Dementors?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.83,0:39:39.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他曾经溜过它们一次。谁能说他不会再干一次？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He slipped past them once. Who's to say he won't do it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.38,0:39:43.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错。布莱克可能在任何地方。就像抓烟一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's right. Black could be anywhere. It's like trying to catch smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.72,0:39:47.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像徒手抓烟一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like trying to catch smoke with your bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.00,0:40:16.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很有意思，不是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Intriguing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.33,0:40:22.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有谁想猜一猜……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Would anyone like to venture a guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.25,0:40:24.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……里面是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...as to what is inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.26,0:40:27.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那是个博格特，没错。  -很好，托马斯先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That's a boggart, that is.   -Very good, Mr. Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.01,0:40:31.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，谁能告诉我博格特长什么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, can anybody tell me what a boggart looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.10,0:40:34.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没人知道。-她什么时候来的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No one knows.   -When did she get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.39,0:40:35.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}博格特是变形者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Boggarts are shape-shifters.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.10,0:40:39.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它们会变成一个人最害怕的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They take the shape of whatever a person fears the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.52,0:40:43.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-所以它们才那么——-那么可怕，对，对，对……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That's what makes them so-- -So terrifying, yes, yes, yes....
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.15,0:40:49.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}幸运的是，有个很简单的咒语可以击退博格特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Luckily, a very simple charm exists to repel a boggart.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.99,0:40:54.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在来练习。请不要拿魔杖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's practice it now. Without wands, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.04,0:40:57.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟我念。滑稽滑稽！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After me. Riddikulus!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.75,0:40:59.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滑稽滑稽！很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Riddikulus! Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.08,0:41:02.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大声点，咬字清楚。听好：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A little louder and very clear. Listen:
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.79,0:41:05.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-滑稽滑稽！  -滑稽滑稽！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Riddikulus!   -Riddikulus!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.21,0:41:07.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这课真荒唐。  -很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-This class is ridiculous. Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.51,0:41:11.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}简单的部分就这些。光有咒语还不够。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So much for the easy part. You see, the incantation alone is not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.72,0:41:15.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真正能解决博格特的是笑声。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What really finishes a boggart is laughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.64,0:41:20.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得逼它变成你觉得真正好笑的样子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You need to force it to assume a shape you find truly amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.23,0:41:24.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来解释。纳威，请你上来好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me explain. Neville, would you join me, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.56,0:41:26.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，别害羞。来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, don't be shy. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.90,0:41:29.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.03,0:41:33.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好。纳威，你最怕什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello. Neville, what frightens you most of all?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.74,0:41:35.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斯内普教授。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Professor Snape.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.62,0:41:37.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-什么？  -斯内普教授。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Sorry?   -Professor Snape.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.62,0:41:41.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斯内普教授。是啊，人人都怕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Professor Snape. Yes, frightens all.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.21,0:41:45.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你和奶奶一起住。  -我也不想它变成她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You live with your grandmother.   -I don't want it to turn into her, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.21,0:41:47.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.63,0:41:51.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……不会的。我要你在脑子里想她的衣服。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..It won't. I want you to picture her clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.68,0:41:54.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只想她的衣服，非常清楚地想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Only her clothes, very clearly, in your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.10,0:41:58.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-她拿着一个红色的手提包——-这个我们不用听。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-She carries a red handbag-- -We don't need to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.35,0:42:02.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要你看得见，我们就看得见。现在，我打开那个衣柜时……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As long as you see it, we'll see it. Now, when I open that wardrobe...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.44,0:42:05.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我要你这么做。失陪一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...nere's what I want you to do. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.19,0:42:09.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想象斯内普教授穿着你奶奶的衣服。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Imagine Professor Snape in your grandmother's clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.32,0:42:11.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能做到吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.61,0:42:14.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能。魔杖举好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. Wand at the ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.66,0:42:18.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一、二、三。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.96,0:42:29.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想，纳威，想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Think, Neville, think.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.59,0:42:34.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滑稽滑稽！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Riddikulus!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.18,0:42:41.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太棒了，纳威，太棒了！不可思议！好……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wonderful, Neville, wonderful! Incredible! Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.06,0:42:44.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……到后面去，纳威。大家排成一队……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...to the back, Neville. Everyone, form a line....
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.19,0:42:52.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}排成一队！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Form a line!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.70,0:42:56.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要每个人想象自己最害怕的东西……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want everyone to picture the thing they fear the very most...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.32,0:42:59.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……把它变成好笑的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and turn it into something funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.62,0:43:01.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下一个！罗恩！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Next! Ron!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.54,0:43:08.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}集中精神。面对你的恐惧。勇敢点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Concentrate. Face your fear. Be brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.55,0:43:21.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}魔杖举好，罗恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wand at the ready, Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.85,0:43:22.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滑稽滑稽！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Riddikulus!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.27,0:43:28.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好！看到了吗？很好，很好！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes! You see? Very good, very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.19,0:43:35.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太精彩了！非常非常有趣！帕瓦蒂！下一个！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Marvelous! Absolutely, very, very enjoyable! Parvati! Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.82,0:43:39.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我们看看你看到了什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Show us what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.29,0:43:51.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别慌。稳住。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep your nerve. Steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.88,0:43:53.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滑稽滑稽！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Riddikulus!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.88,0:43:56.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下一个！上来，上来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And next! Step up, step up!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.93,0:43:59.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太棒了，太棒了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wonderful, wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.78,0:44:15.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这儿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.74,0:44:23.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滑稽滑稽！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Riddikulus!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.09,0:44:35.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。抱歉。今天就到这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. Sorry about that. That's enough for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.17,0:44:37.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到后面去拿你们的书。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Collect your books from the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.34,0:44:39.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下课了。谢谢！抱歉！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the end of the lesson. Thank you! Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.14,0:44:43.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，好事也不能过头。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry, you can have too much of a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.18,0:44:49.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记住，去霍格莫德村是一种特权。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Remember, these visits to Hogsmeade village are a privilege.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.06,0:44:52.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你们的行为给学校抹黑……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Should your behavior reflect poorly on the school...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.06,0:44:55.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……这项特权将不再延续。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that privilege shall not be extended again.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.44,0:44:59.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有签名的许可表，就不能去村里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No permission form signed, no visiting the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.91,0:45:01.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是规定，波特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the rule, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.66,0:45:04.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有许可的跟我来。没有的留在原地。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Those with permission, follow me. Those without, stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.04,0:45:07.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为如果您签了字，我就能——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought if you signed it, then I could--
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.70,0:45:10.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能。只有父母或监护人才能签。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't. Only a parent or a guardian can sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.37,0:45:13.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}既然我两者都不是，那就不合适。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Since I am neither, it would be inappropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.88,0:45:20.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，波特。这是我最后的答复。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, Potter. That's my final word.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.68,0:45:24.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}算了，伙计们。回头见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Forget about it, guys. See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.74,0:45:40.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}教授，我能问您点事吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Professor, can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.99,0:45:44.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想知道我为什么拦住你，不让你面对那个博格特，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to know why I stopped you facing that boggart, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.03,0:45:46.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为这很明显。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought it'd be obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.62,0:45:49.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为它会变成伏地魔的样子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I assumed it would take the shape of Lord Voldemort.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.62,0:45:53.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我起初确实想到了伏地魔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I did think of Voldemort at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.33,0:45:55.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但后来我想起了火车上的那一晚……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But then I remembered that night on the train...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.13,0:45:58.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……还有那个摄魂怪。 -我很佩服。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-...and the dementor.   -I'm very impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.84,0:46:01.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这说明你最怕的是恐惧本身。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That suggests what you fear the most is fear itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.88,0:46:03.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这非常明智。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is very wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.55,0:46:05.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在我昏过去之前……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Before I fainted...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.89,0:46:07.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我听到了什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I heard something.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.43,0:46:10.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个女人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.52,0:46:11.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……在尖叫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.06,0:46:15.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}摄魂怪逼我们重温最可怕的记忆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dementors force us to relive our very worst memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.52,0:46:18.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的痛苦成了它们的力量。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our pain becomes their power.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.28,0:46:21.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想那是我母亲……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think it was my mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.65,0:46:23.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……她被杀害的那晚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the night she was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.49,0:46:29.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我第一次见到你，哈利，就立刻认出了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The very first time I saw you, Harry, I recognized you immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.54,0:46:33.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是靠你的伤疤，而是你的眼睛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not by your scar, by your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.79,0:46:35.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是你母亲莉莉的眼睛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're your mother, Lily's.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.88,0:46:38.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.67,0:46:41.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，是的。我认识她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yes. I knew her.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.01,0:46:47.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在我孤立无援的时候，你母亲陪伴着我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your mother was there for me at a time when no one else was.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.06,0:46:51.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她不仅是一位天赋非凡的女巫……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not only was she a singularly gifted witch...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.43,0:46:54.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……还是一个极其善良的女人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... she was also an uncommonly kind woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.27,0:46:58.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她总能看到别人身上的美……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She had a way of seeing the beauty in others...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.52,0:47:04.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……甚至，尤其是当那个人自己看不到的时候。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...even, and most especially, when that person could not see it in themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.16,0:47:08.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而你父亲詹姆斯，就另当别论了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And your father, James, on the other hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.04,0:47:10.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ne...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.08,0:47:14.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他有一种，怎么说呢，惹麻烦的天赋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He had a certain, shall we say, talent for trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.71,0:47:22.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}据说，他把这种天赋传给了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A talent, rumor has it, he passed on to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.22,0:47:29.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你比你想象的更像他们，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're more like them than you know, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.01,0:47:33.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总有一天，你会明白有多像。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In time, you'll come to see just how much.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.60,0:47:40.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜂蜜公爵糖果店很棒，但什么都比不过佐科笑话店。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honeyduke's Sweetshop is brilliant, but nothing beats Zonko's Joke Shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.19,0:47:43.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们一直没能去尖叫棚屋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We never got to go to the Shrieking Shack.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.90,0:47:47.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你听说过它是英国最——闹鬼的建筑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You heard it's the most-- Haunted building in Britain.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.32,0:47:50.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.99,0:47:53.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大概纳威又忘了口令。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Probably Neville forgot the password again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.62,0:47:56.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。哦，你在啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey. Oh, you're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.21,0:48:00.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请让我过去。借过！我是男生学生会主席！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me through, please. Excuse me! I'm Head Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.13,0:48:03.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后，你们都退后。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get back, all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.96,0:48:07.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在搜查完毕之前，谁也不许进入这间宿舍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No one is to enter this dormitory until it's been searched.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.30,0:48:08.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胖夫人！她不见了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Fat Lady! She's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.72,0:48:13.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她活该。她唱歌难听死了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Serves her right. She was a terrible singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.35,0:48:14.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不好笑，罗恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not funny, Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.27,0:48:19.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家保持冷静。分成四队。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep calm, everyone. Break into fours.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.44,0:48:21.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回你们的公共休息室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Back to your common room.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.70,0:48:30.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安静。校长来了。快，走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Be quiet. The headmaster's here. Come on, move.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.12,0:48:32.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听见了，快走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You heard. Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.22,0:48:50.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}费尔奇先生？把幽灵们召集起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Filch? Round up the ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.43,0:48:54.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叫他们搜查城堡里每一幅画，找到胖夫人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell them to search every painting in the castle to find the Fat Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.72,0:48:57.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不需要幽灵，教授。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's no need for ghosts, professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.64,0:48:59.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胖夫人在那儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Fat Lady's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.60,0:49:03.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看着点路！慢点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mind where you're going! Slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.19,0:49:06.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你听着！我是男生学生会主席！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You listen! I'm Head Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.03,0:49:09.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回来！继续走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come back here! Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.03,0:49:15.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲爱的女士，是谁对你下的手？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dear lady, who did this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.83,0:49:22.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他有一双魔鬼般的眼睛，灵魂和他的名字一样黑暗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Eyes like the devil, he's got, and a soul as dark as his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.79,0:49:26.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是他，校长。就是大家议论的那个人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's him, headmaster. The one they all talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.96,0:49:30.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他就在这里，就在城堡的某个地方！小天狼星·布莱克！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's here, somewhere in the castle! Sirius Black!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.05,0:49:37.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}封锁城堡，费尔奇先生。其余的人，去大礼堂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Secure the castle, Mr. Filch. The rest of you, to the Great Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.25,0:50:10.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我搜了天文塔和猫头鹰棚屋。什么都没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I searched the Astronomy Tower and the Owlery. There's nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.34,0:50:12.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。这一层没问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you. The floor's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.09,0:50:15.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。地牢我查过了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good. I've done the dungeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.43,0:50:17.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有布莱克的踪影，城堡其他地方也没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No sign of Black, nor anywhere else in the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.10,0:50:20.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我其实没指望他会逗留。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't really expect him to linger.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.85,0:50:24.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}了不起的壮举，你不觉得吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Remarkable feat, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.36,0:50:26.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}独自进入霍格沃茨城堡……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To enter Hogwarts Castle on one's own...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.82,0:50:29.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……完全没被发现？相当了不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-...completely undetected? Quite remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.69,0:50:31.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对他怎么做到的，有什么推测吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Any theories on how he managed it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.74,0:50:34.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很多。每一个都和下一个一样不靠谱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Many. Each as unlikely as the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.95,0:50:36.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可能还记得……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You may recall...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.66,0:50:39.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……学期开始前，我表达过担忧……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...prior to the start of term I expressed concerns...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.66,0:50:41.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……关于你任命教授——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...about your appointment of Professor--
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.91,0:50:46.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这座城堡里没有一位教授会帮助小天狼星·布莱克进来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not a single professor inside this castle would help Sirius Black enter it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.17,0:50:48.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我确信城堡是安全的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm quite convinced the castle is safe...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.75,0:50:52.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我也非常愿意让学生们回各自的学院。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and I'm more than willing to send the students to their houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.55,0:50:54.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}波特呢？该警告他吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What about Potter? Should he be warned?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.09,0:50:57.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许吧。但现在，让他睡吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Perhaps. But for now, let him sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.60,0:51:03.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为在梦里，我们进入一个完全属于自己的世界。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For in dreams, we enter a world that's entirely our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.60,0:51:10.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让他们在深海畅游，或在最高的云端滑翔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let them swim in the deepest ocean or glide over the highest cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.44,0:51:50.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}翻到第394页。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turn to page 394.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.20,0:52:03.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打扰一下，先生。卢平教授在哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me, sir. Where's Professor Lupin?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.50,0:52:07.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不关你的事，波特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not really your concern, is it, Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.08,0:52:11.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}简单说吧，你们的教授发现自己无法授课……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Suffice it to say your professor finds himself incapable of teaching...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.17,0:52:17.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……至少目前是这样。翻到394页。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...at the present time. Turn to page 394.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.06,0:52:23.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“狼人”？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Werewolves"?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.06,0:52:26.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生，我们刚学完红帽子和欣奇朋克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir, we just learned about red caps and hinkypunks.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.06,0:52:30.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我们还有好几周才学这个。  -安静。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We're not meant to start that for weeks.   -Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.40,0:52:33.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她什么时候进来的？你看见她进来了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When did she come in? Did you see her come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.19,0:52:37.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，你们谁能告诉我区别……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, which one of you can tell me the difference...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.90,0:52:40.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……阿尼马格斯和狼人之间的区别？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...between an Animagus and a werewolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.03,0:52:42.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没人知道？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No one?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.45,0:52:46.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-真令人失望。  -先生，请让我回答。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-How disappointing. Please, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.58,0:52:49.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿尼马格斯是自愿变成动物的巫师。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}An Animagus is a wizard who elects to turn into an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.92,0:52:51.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}狼人则别无选择。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A werewolf has no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.88,0:52:53.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每当满月……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With each full moon...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.75,0:52:57.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……他就不再记得自己是谁。他会杀死自己最好的朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... he no longer remembers who he is. He'd kill his best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.84,0:53:00.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}狼人只回应同类的呼唤。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The werewolf only responds to the call of its own kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.60,0:53:05.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你，马尔福。这是第二次……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, Mr. Malfoy. That's the second time...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.52,0:53:07.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你未经允许擅自发言了，格兰杰小姐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... you've spoken out of turn, Miss Granger.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.02,0:53:10.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是管不住自己……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you incapable of restraining yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.19,0:53:13.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……还是以当个讨人厌的万事通为荣？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...or do you take pride in being an insufferable know-it-all?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.82,0:53:17.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他说得没错。  -格兰芬多扣五分。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He's got a point, you know.   -Five points from Gryffindor.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.44,0:53:22.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了医治你的无知，周一早上交到我桌上……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As an antidote to your ignorance, and on my desk, by Monday morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.24,0:53:25.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……两卷关于狼人的羊皮纸论文，重点……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...two rolls of parchment on the werewolf, with emphasis...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.12,0:53:28.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-……讲如何辨认狼人。  -明天有魁地奇比赛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-...0n recognizing it.   -It's Quidditch tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.79,0:53:33.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我建议你格外小心，波特先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then I suggest you take extra care, Mr. Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.34,0:53:37.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}断手断脚也免不了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Loss of limb will not excuse you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.59,0:53:41.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}394页。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Page 394.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.34,0:53:44.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“狼人”这个词……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The term "werewolf"...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.72,0:53:50.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……是由盎格鲁-撒克逊语“wer”缩合而成……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...IS a contraction of the Anglo-Saxon word "wer"...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.98,0:53:55.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……意思是“人”，再加上“狼”。Werewolf，人狼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...which means "man," and "wolf." Werewolf, man-wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.07,0:53:58.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}变成狼人有几种途径。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There are several ways to become a werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.61,0:54:01.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}包括被赋予变形的能力……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They include being given the power of shape-shifting...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.86,0:54:03.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……被狼人咬……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...being bitten by a werewolf...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.59,0:54:26.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}加油，哈利！加油，哈利！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go, Harry! Go, Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.01,0:56:28.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咒立停！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aresto momentum!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.10,0:56:34.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他看起来有点虚弱，是不是？虚弱？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He looks a bit peaky, doesn't he? Peaky?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.39,0:56:36.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还指望什么？他从一百多英尺高摔下来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you expect? He fell over 100 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.85,0:56:39.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们从塔上把你推下去，看看你什么样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's walk you off a tower and see what you look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.94,0:56:42.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大概比他平时好看多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Probably a right sight better than he normally does.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.65,0:56:49.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你感觉怎么样？  -哦，好极了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-How are you feeling?   -Oh, brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.82,0:56:51.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你吓了我们一大跳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You gave us a right good scare.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.03,0:56:55.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}发生了什么？嗯，你从扫帚上摔了下来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What happened? Well, you fell off your broom.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.83,0:56:58.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的？我是说比赛。谁赢了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really? I meant the match. Who won?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.83,0:57:04.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，没人怪你，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, no one blames you, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.50,0:57:08.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}摄魂怪不该出现在校园里。邓布利多气坏了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dementors aren't supposed to be on the grounds. Dumbledore's furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.55,0:57:10.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他救了你之后，把它们赶走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After he saved you, he sent them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.80,0:57:14.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有件事你也该知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's something else you should know too.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.02,0:57:21.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你摔下来的时候，你的扫帚被吹进了打人柳，然后……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When you fell, your broom sort of blew into the Whomping Willow, and....
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.86,0:57:23.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.61,0:57:26.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的扫帚的事，我很遗憾。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry to hear about your broomstick.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.24,0:57:29.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没法修好了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is there no chance of fixing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.03,0:57:31.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没办法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.57,0:57:34.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}教授，为什么摄魂怪对我的影响这么大？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Professor, why do the dementors affect me so?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.33,0:57:38.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我是说，比其他人更大？  -听着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I mean, more than everyone else?   -Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.58,0:57:41.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}摄魂怪是世上最邪恶的生物。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dementors are the foulest creatures to walk this earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.96,0:57:46.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它们吸食一切美好的情感、快乐的记忆……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They feed on every good feeling, every happy memory...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.76,0:57:51.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……直到人只剩最惨痛的记忆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...until a person is left with absolutely nothing but his worst experiences.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.55,0:57:55.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你并不软弱，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are not weak, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.93,0:58:00.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}摄魂怪对你影响最大，因为你过去经历过真正的恐怖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dementors affect you most because there are true horrors in your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.23,0:58:03.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的同学几乎无法想象的恐怖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Horrors your classmates can scarcely imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.77,0:58:06.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没什么可羞愧的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have nothing to be ashamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.27,0:58:10.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我害怕，教授。  -你要是不怕，我才觉得你傻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm scared, professor.   -I'd consider you a fool if you weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.49,0:58:13.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得学会怎么对抗它们。你可以教我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need to know how to fight them. You could teach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.16,0:58:16.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}火车上那只被你赶走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You made the one on the train go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.37,0:58:18.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那晚只有一只。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There was only one that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.41,0:58:23.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-可你把它赶走了。  -我并不假装自己是专家，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-But you made it go away.   -I don't pretend to be an expert, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.33,0:58:28.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但既然摄魂怪似乎对你产生了兴趣……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But as the dementors seem to have developed an interest in you...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.46,0:58:32.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……也许我该教你。但要等假期之后。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...perhaps I should teach you. But after the holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.30,0:58:34.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，我需要休息。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For now, I need to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.66,0:59:03.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去霍格莫德的最后召集！快点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Last call for Hogsmeade! Come on, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.56,0:59:21.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伙计们，放开我。挺聪明，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Guys, let me go. Clever, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.72,0:59:24.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但还不够聪明。我们有更好的办法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But not clever enough. We've got a better way.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.81,0:59:27.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想去霍格莫德。-我们知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm trying to get to Hogsmeade. We know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.81,0:59:28.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们会送你去的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll get you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.11,0:59:31.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们带你走条更快的路。只要你闭嘴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll show you a quicker way. If you pipe down.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.07,0:59:35.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-保佑他。  -放开我！拜托。别——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Bless him. Let me go! Come on. Don't--
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.28,0:59:38.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，哈利。来加入大男孩们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, Harry. Come and join the big boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.28,0:59:42.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你干什么？！  -嘘！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What are you doing?! Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.66,0:59:45.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这是什么破玩意儿？  -“什么破玩意儿？”他说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What's this rubbish?   -"What's this rubbish?" he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.66,0:59:49.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这是我们成功的秘密。  -把它给你还真舍不得——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's the secret to our success.   -It's a wrench giving it to you--
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.17,0:59:52.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们觉得你比我们更需要它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But we've decided your needs are greater than ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.26,0:59:54.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乔治，请吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}George, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.17,0:59:57.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我庄严宣誓我不干好事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I solemnly swear that I am up to no good.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.10,1:00:04.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“月亮脸、虫尾巴、大脚板和尖头叉子先生……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Messrs. Moony, Wormiail, Padfoot and Prongs...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.10,1:00:08.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……荣幸地推出活点地图。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...are proud to present the Marauder's Map."
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.31,1:00:10.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们欠他们太多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We owe them so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.11,1:00:17.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。这是霍格沃茨。那是——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hang on. This is Hogwarts. And that--
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.12,1:00:20.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不会吧。那真的是——？  -邓布利多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No. Is that really--?   -Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.74,1:00:22.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-在他的书房里。  -来回踱步。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-In his study.   -Pacing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.24,1:00:24.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他常这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Does that a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.41,1:00:25.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以这张地图显示——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So this map shows--
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.75,1:00:26.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有人。-所有人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Everyone.   -Everyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.04,1:00:28.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他们在哪。  -他们在干什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Where they are.   -What they do.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.62,1:00:29.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-每一分钟。  -每一天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Every minute.   -Every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.92,1:00:32.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-太棒了！你从哪儿弄来的？  -费尔奇的办公室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Brilliant! Where did you get it?   -From Filch's office.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.09,1:00:35.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-一年级的时候。  -有七条秘密通道……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-First year.   -There are seven secret passageways...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.01,1:00:38.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-……通往城堡外。  -我们推荐这条。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-...out of the castle.   -We'd recommend this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.84,1:00:42.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-独眼女巫通道。能通到蜂蜜公爵。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-The One-Eyed Witch passageway. Leads you to Honeyduke's.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.18,1:00:44.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快。费尔奇往这边来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hurry. Filch is heading this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.18,1:00:47.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别忘了。用完之后，敲一下它，说：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And don't forget. When you're done, just give it a tap and say:
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.77,1:00:52.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“恶作剧结束。”否则谁都能看见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Mischief managed." Otherwise, anyone can read it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.43,1:01:29.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说吧，你想要多少？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, how much do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.94,1:01:38.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真好吃。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.87,1:01:49.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}据说这是英国最闹鬼的房子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's meant to be the most haunted building in Britain.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.08,1:01:52.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我提过吗？  -提过两遍了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Did I mention that? Twice.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.67,1:01:55.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦。要不要再靠近点儿？  -啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh. Do you want to move a bit closer?   -Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.05,1:02:00.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-去尖叫棚屋？  -哦，其实我待在这儿就挺好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-To the Shrieking Shack?   -Oh. Actually, I'm fine here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.09,1:02:02.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哟，哟。看看谁来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, well. Look who's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.30,1:02:05.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们俩在挑梦想新居吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You two shopping for your new dream home?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.80,1:02:10.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对你来说太气派了吧，黄鼠狼？你们家不是一家人挤一间屋睡吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bit grand for you, isn't it, Weasle-Bee? Don't your family sleep in one room?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.31,1:02:13.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-闭上你的嘴，马尔福。  -真不友好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Shut your mouth, Malfoy.   -Not very friendly.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.81,1:02:17.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伙计们，该教教黄鼠狼怎么尊敬长辈了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Boys, I think it's time we teach Weasle-Bee how to respect his superiors.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.15,1:02:22.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-希望你说的不是你自己。  -你竟敢这么跟我说话！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hope you don't mean yourself.   -How dare you talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.74,1:02:24.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这个肮脏的泥巴种！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You filthy little mudblood!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.95,1:02:30.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.71,1:02:39.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-别傻站着！快想办法！  -什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Don't stand there! Do something!   -What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.90,1:03:01.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了，马尔福？找不着北了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's up, Malfoy? Lost your skis?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.16,1:03:06.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让开！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.74,1:03:08.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快闪开！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.83,1:03:11.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马尔福！等等！等等！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Malfoy! Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.58,1:03:17.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.71,1:03:21.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，哈利。这可不怎么好笑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bloody hell, Harry. That was not funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.92,1:03:26.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那对黄鼠狼！从没跟我说过什么活点地图。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Those weasels! Never told me about any Marauder's Map.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.39,1:03:29.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不会留着。他会交给麦格教授。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He won't keep it. He'll turn it over to Professor McGonagall.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.06,1:03:31.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也不会，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.39,1:03:34.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。连同他的隐形斗篷一起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure. Along with his Invisibility Cloak.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.18,1:03:36.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看是谁来了。罗斯默塔夫人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look who it is. Madam Rosmerta.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.90,1:03:39.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-罗恩喜欢她。  -才不是！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Ron fancies her. That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.36,1:03:41.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}麦格！康奈利！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}McGonagall! Cornelius!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.40,1:03:42.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来吧，部长。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Allow me, minister.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.99,1:03:44.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，海格……抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Hagrid.... Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.03,1:03:47.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗斯默塔，亲爱的。希望生意兴隆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rosmerta, my dear. I hope business is good.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.16,1:03:52.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是部里不派摄魂怪来，会好得多……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'd be a lot better if the Ministry wasn't sending dementors...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.20,1:03:56.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}—……隔三差五就闯进我的酒吧！我们……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-...Into my pub every other night! We have....
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.67,1:03:59.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}—我们有杀人犯在逃。西里斯·布莱克就在霍格莫德！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We have a killer on the loose. Sirius Black in Hogsmeade!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.21,1:04:02.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那他来这儿干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And what would bring him here?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.84,1:04:05.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利·波特。—哈利·波特？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Harry Potter.   -Harry Potter?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.01,1:04:08.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}—嘘！过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Shh! Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.47,1:04:13.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.19,1:04:25.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-今天未成年巫师一律不许进！  -把那该死的门关上！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No underage wizards allowed in today!   -Shut the damn door!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.86,1:04:27.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-太无礼了。  -木头脑袋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-So rude.   -Thick heads.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.86,1:04:30.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}木头？！他们竟敢这么说！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thick?! How dare they!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.53,1:04:33.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}—他们说的是谁？小兔崽子！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Who are they calling that? Whippersnappers!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.83,1:04:37.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没人愿意来一个吓得人魂飞魄散的酒吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nobody will come to a pub where they'll get scared out of their wits.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.92,1:04:41.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}邓布利多教授不希望摄魂怪出现在这一带。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Professor Dumbledore doesn't want dementors around the place.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.63,1:04:46.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟我说说这到底是怎么回事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell me what this is all about.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.59,1:04:51.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多年前，哈利·波特的父母意识到自己已被列入死亡名单——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Years ago, when Harry Potter's parents realized they were marked for death--
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.22,1:04:53.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记得吗？他们躲了起来。没几个人知道他们在哪儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Remember? They hid. Few knew where they were.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.10,1:04:57.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其中之一就是西里斯·布莱克。他告诉了神秘人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One who did was Sirius Black. And he told You-Know-Who.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.14,1:05:01.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那晚布莱克不仅把神秘人引到了波特夫妇那儿……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not only did Black lead him to the Potters that night...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.52,1:05:04.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……还杀了小矮星彼得！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...he also killed Peter Pettigrew!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.15,1:05:07.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小矮星彼得？—一个小胖墩儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Peter Pettigrew?   -Little lump of a boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.49,1:05:09.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}—总跟在布莱克屁股后头。我记得。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Trailing after Black. I remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.74,1:05:11.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}眼睛一刻也不离开詹姆和西里斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never let James and Sirius out of his sight.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.91,1:05:14.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}—然后呢？他想去警告他们……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What happened? He tried to warn them...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.83,1:05:19.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……本来也许能，要不是他撞上了老朋友西里斯·布莱克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and might have, had he not run into an old friend, Sirius Black.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.21,1:05:23.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布莱克心狠手辣。他没有杀死小矮星。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Black was vicious. He didn't kill Pettigrew.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.25,1:05:25.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他把他炸成了碎片！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He destroyed him!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.05,1:05:30.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一根手指。就剩下这个。一根手指。别的什么都没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A finger. That's all that was left. A finger. Nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.97,1:05:34.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}西里斯·布莱克也许没有亲手害死波特夫妇……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sirius Black may not have put his hands to the Potters...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.18,1:05:37.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-……但他们是因他而死。  -他想把事情了结。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-...0ut he's the reason they're dead.   -He wants to finish things.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.60,1:05:40.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不信。这还不是最糟的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't believe it. That's not the worst.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.64,1:05:44.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还能有什么更糟的？—这个：西里斯·布莱克是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What could be worse?   -This: Sirius Black was...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.61,1:05:46.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……而且至今仍是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and remains to this day...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.19,1:05:48.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……哈利·波特的教父！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... Harry Potter's godfather!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.45,1:05:59.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗恩，快看！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ron, look!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.46,1:06:08.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}借过，借过。圣诞快乐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me, excuse me. Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.50,1:06:48.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利，怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.84,1:06:52.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是他们的朋友……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was their friend...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.47,1:06:55.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……却背叛了他们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and he betrayed them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.51,1:06:58.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他可是他们的朋友！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was their friend!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.72,1:07:02.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我希望他来找我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hope he finds me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.31,1:07:05.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为等他来了，我就准备好了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because when he does, I'm gonna be ready!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.10,1:07:08.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等他来了，我要杀了他！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When he does, I'm gonna kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.00,1:07:24.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.12,1:07:26.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你来了。你真的来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There you are. You came.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.17,1:07:31.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确定要学吗，哈利？这是非常高深的魔法……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you sure about this, Harry? This is very advanced magic...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.21,1:07:33.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……远远超出普通巫师等级考试的水平。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...well beyond the Ordinary Wizarding Level.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.84,1:07:35.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我确定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.97,1:07:38.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，一切都准备好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, everything's prepared.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.68,1:07:42.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要教你的咒语叫守护神咒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The spell I'm going to teach you is called the Patronus Charm.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.27,1:07:43.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你听说过吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you ever hear of it?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.89,1:07:45.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有？那……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No? Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.73,1:07:49.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}守护神是一种正面的力量。对召唤出它的巫师来说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A Patronus is a positive force. For the wizard who conjures one...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.48,1:07:54.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……它就像一面盾牌，摄魂怪会吸食它，而不是吸食巫师本人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...it works like a shield, with the dementor feeding on it rather than him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.32,1:07:58.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但要让咒语生效，你得想一段记忆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But in order for it to work, you need to think of a memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.32,1:08:02.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是随便什么记忆，要一段非常快乐的、非常有力的记忆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not just any memory, a very happy memory, a very powerful memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.50,1:08:06.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能做到吗？能。很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you do this? Yes. Very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.50,1:08:09.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闭上眼睛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.50,1:08:13.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}集中精神。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.63,1:08:16.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在记忆中搜寻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Explore your past.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.22,1:08:19.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}找到记忆了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you have a memory?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.68,1:08:22.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让它充满你全身。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Allow it to fill you up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.60,1:08:25.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让自己沉浸其中。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lose yourself within it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.02,1:08:31.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后念出咒语：呼神护卫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then speak the incantation, Expecto Patronum.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.77,1:08:34.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-呼神护卫。  -很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Expecto Patronum.   -Very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.41,1:08:41.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开始吧？举起魔杖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shall we? Wand at the ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.26,1:09:02.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼神护卫！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Expecto Patronum!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.64,1:09:06.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼神……呼神……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Expecto.... Expecto....
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.56,1:09:08.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼神……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Expect...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.27,1:09:14.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。坐起来。深呼吸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here we go. Come on. Sit up. Deep breaths.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.65,1:09:18.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没关系。我没指望你第一次就能成功。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all right. I didn't expect you to do it the first time.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.86,1:09:23.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那可就太了不起了。来，吃点这个，你会好些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That would have been remarkable. Here, eat this. You'll feel better.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.83,1:09:27.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那摄魂怪真够呛。  -不不不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That's one nasty dementor.   -Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.91,1:09:30.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是博格特，哈利。博格特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was a boggart, Harry. A boggart.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.83,1:09:34.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的会更糟。糟得多，多得多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The real thing would be worse. Much, much worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.17,1:09:36.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}顺便问一下，你当时在想什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As a matter of interest, what were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.96,1:09:40.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你选了哪段记忆？  -我第一次骑扫帚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Which memory did you choose?   -The first time I rode a broom.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.89,1:09:45.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那不够。远远不够。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not good enough. Not nearly good enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.10,1:09:57.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有一段。它算不上快乐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's another. It's not happy, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.28,1:10:01.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实算是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.57,1:10:04.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是我最快乐的时候……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's the happiest I've ever felt...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.32,1:10:08.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-……但它很复杂。  -够强烈吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-...but it's complicated.   -ls it strong?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.67,1:10:15.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就试试。你觉得准备好了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then let's give it a try. You feel ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.30,1:10:19.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.10,1:10:32.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼神护卫！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Expecto Patronum!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.60,1:10:37.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼神护卫！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Expecto Patronum!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.17,1:11:00.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}成了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.22,1:11:05.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得好，哈利。干得好！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well done, Harry. Well done!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.18,1:11:10.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-今天就到这儿吧。  -好，坐下。来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I think I've had enough for today.   -Yes. Sit down. Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.48,1:11:12.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吃点这个，有帮助。真的有用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Eat this, it helps. It really helps.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.06,1:11:14.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有，我跟你说，哈利……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And just so you know, Harry...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.02,1:11:17.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你父亲在你这年纪也未必比得上你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I think you'd have given your father a run for his money.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.90,1:11:21.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这话可不是随便说的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that is saying something.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.40,1:11:25.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想的是他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was thinking of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.57,1:11:27.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有妈妈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And Mum.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.91,1:11:30.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看见他们的脸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seeing their faces.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.79,1:11:33.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们在跟我说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They were talking to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.66,1:11:35.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.08,1:11:38.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我选的就是这段记忆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the memory I chose.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.05,1:11:42.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我甚至不知道那是不是真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't even know if it's real.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.01,1:11:45.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我只有这个最好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But it's the best I have.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.39,1:11:56.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-天气真好。  -美极了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Beautiful day.   -Gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.90,1:11:58.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非你被撕成碎片！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unless you've been ripped to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.06,1:12:01.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}撕成碎片？你在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ripped to pieces? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.65,1:12:04.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-罗纳德把老鼠弄丢了。  -我什么都没弄丢！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Ronald has lost his rat.   -I haven't lost anything!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.99,1:12:07.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你的猫害死了他！  -胡说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Your cat killed him!   -Rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.28,1:12:10.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利，你也见过她那嗜血的畜生……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry, you've seen the way that bloodthirsty beast of hers...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.78,1:12:14.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……总在附近转悠。而斑斑不见了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..1S always lurking about. And Scabbers is gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.87,1:12:17.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你就该好好看管你的宠物！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, maybe you should take better care of your pets!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.92,1:12:20.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的猫害死了他！-才没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your cat killed him! Did not.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.17,1:12:21.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是。-不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did. Didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.71,1:12:26.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听证会怎么样，海格？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How did it go, Hagrid? The hearing?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.51,1:12:29.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，先是委员会成员轮流……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, first off, the committee members took turns...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.97,1:12:32.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……说明我们为什么在场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...talking about why we were there.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.52,1:12:37.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我站起来做了陈述。说巴克比克……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got up and did my piece. Said how Buckbeak...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.35,1:12:40.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……是只善良的鹰头马身有翼兽，总把羽毛梳理得干干净净。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Was a good hippogriff, always cleaned his feathers.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.52,1:12:43.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后卢修斯·马尔福站了起来。你能想象。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then Lucius Malfoy got up. Well, you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.73,1:12:46.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说巴克比克是只致命危险的生物……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He said Buckbeak was a deadly and dangerous creature...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.11,1:12:50.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……一见你就想杀你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...who would kill you as soon as look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.37,1:12:52.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.87,1:12:55.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后老卢修斯要求最严的惩罚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then he asked for the worst, did old Lucius.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.75,1:12:59.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们没开除你！-没有，我没被开除。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're not sacking you! No, I'm not sacked.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.96,1:13:04.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}巴克比克被判死刑了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Buckbeak's been sentenced to death!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.74,1:13:37.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛！有——有蜘蛛。蜘蛛。它们想让我跳踢踏舞。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Spiders! There's-- There's spiders. Spiders. They want me to tap-dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.58,1:13:40.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我不想跳踢踏舞！  -那就告诉那些蜘蛛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I don't wanna tap-dance!   -Tell those spiders.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.33,1:13:44.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，好。告诉它们。我会告诉它们……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right, yeah. Tell them. I'll tell them....
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.44,1:14:04.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}彼得·佩迪鲁？一个笨拙的男孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Peter Pettigrew? Lump of a boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.98,1:14:07.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-总跟在西里斯·布莱克后面。布莱克很凶残。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Always trailing after Sirius Black. Black was vicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.11,1:14:10.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不是杀了佩迪鲁，是把他毁掉了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He didn't kill Pettigrew, he destroyed him!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.66,1:14:22.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-把灯关了！  -抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Put that light out!   -Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.38,1:15:07.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-小心点，小子。  -我们这儿要睡觉！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Watch it there, boy.   -We're trying to sleep here!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.96,1:15:09.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，我们要睡觉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.72,1:15:20.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恶作剧完毕。诺克斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mischief managed. Nox.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.52,1:15:23.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}波特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.02,1:15:27.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你大半夜在走廊里游荡什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing wandering the corridors at night?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.69,1:15:28.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在梦游。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was sleepwalking.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.02,1:15:31.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可真像你父亲，波特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How extraordinarily like your father you are, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.74,1:15:36.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他也极其傲慢，在城堡里大摇大摆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He, too, was exceedingly arrogant, strutting about the castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.70,1:15:41.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸爸没有大摇大摆。我也没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My dad didn't strut. And nor do lI.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.79,1:15:44.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不介意的话，请你把魔杖放下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you don't mind, I would appreciate it if you could lower your wand.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.42,1:15:50.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把口袋掏出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turn out your pockets.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.92,1:15:54.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把口袋掏出来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turn out your pockets!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.47,1:15:59.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.26,1:16:02.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-一张废羊皮纸。  -是吗？打开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Spare bit of parchment.   -Really? Open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.02,1:16:12.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}显露你的秘密。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Reveal your secrets.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.57,1:16:18.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}念。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Read it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.49,1:16:26.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“月亮脸、虫尾巴、大脚板和尖头叉子先生……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Messrs. Moony, Wormtail, Padfoot, and Prongs...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.16,1:16:30.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……向斯内普教授致意，并……”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Offer their compliments to Professor Snape and...."
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.59,1:16:32.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继续。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.26,1:16:37.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“并请求他别把大鼻子伸进别人的事里。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"And request he keep his large nose out of other people's business."
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.34,1:16:39.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你这无礼的小——-教授！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You insolent little-- -Professor!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.51,1:16:44.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好啊，好啊。卢平。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, well. Lupin.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.39,1:16:49.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们这是趁着月光出来散步吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Out for a little walk in the moonlight, are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.48,1:16:52.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利，你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.11,1:16:55.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那还难说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That remains to be seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.40,1:17:00.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刚没收了一件相当奇怪的物品。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have now just confiscated a rather curious artifact.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.32,1:17:03.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看吧，卢平。据说这是你的专长领域。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take a look, Lupin. Supposed to be your area of expertise.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.04,1:17:08.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-显然，里面满是黑魔法。  -我很怀疑，西弗勒斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Clearly, it's full of dark magic.   -I seriously doubt it, Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.00,1:17:12.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看起来这羊皮纸就是用来侮辱任何……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It looks as though it's a parchment designed to insult anyone...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.67,1:17:16.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……想读它的人。我猜这是佐科的玩意儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...who tries to read it. I suspect it's a Zonko product.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.72,1:17:20.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尽管如此，我会查清它可能隐藏的特性。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nevertheless, I shall investigate any hidden qualities it may possess.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.14,1:17:24.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}毕竟，如你所说，这是我的专长领域。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is, after all, as you say, my area of expertise.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.43,1:17:27.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利，跟我来。教授，晚安。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry, would you come with me, please? Professor, good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.77,1:17:36.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你聋了吗？把灯关了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you deaf? Put that light out!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.62,1:17:43.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}进来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.87,1:17:50.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我完全不知道这地图怎么落到你手里的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I haven't the faintest idea how this map came to be in your possession...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.25,1:17:54.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……但说实话，你没上交让我很吃惊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but quite frankly, I am astounded that you didn't hand it in.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.92,1:17:58.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你难道没想到，这东西落到西里斯·布莱克手里……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did it never occur to you that this, in the hands of Sirius Black...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.76,1:18:00.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……就是一张指路的地图？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...1S a map to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.59,1:18:04.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-没有。  -没有，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No.   -No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.06,1:18:09.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你父亲也从不把规矩当回事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your father never set much store by the rules either.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.27,1:18:13.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可他和你的母亲牺牲生命救了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But he and your mother gave their lives to save yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.23,1:18:18.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你却在城堡里不设防地乱逛，拿他们的牺牲冒险……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gambling their sacrifice by wandering the castle unprotected...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.48,1:18:22.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……尤其还有杀人犯逍遥法外，我觉得这可不是报答他们的好方式！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...with a killer on the loose seems to me a poor way to repay them!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.16,1:18:25.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，我不会再替你遮掩了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, I will not cover up for you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.49,1:18:27.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-听见了吗？  -听见了，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Do you hear me?   -Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.12,1:18:31.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你回宿舍，待在那儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want you to return to your dormitory and stay there.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.96,1:18:36.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别绕路。不然我会知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And don't take any detours. If you do, I shall know.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.38,1:18:45.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}教授，跟你说一下，我觉得那张地图不总是管用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Professor, just so you know, I don't think that map always works.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.68,1:18:51.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刚才它显示城堡里有个人。一个我知道已经死了的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Earlier, it showed someone in the castle. Someone I know to be dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.06,1:18:54.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，是吗？那是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, really? And who might that be?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.98,1:18:56.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小矮星彼得。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Peter Pettigrew.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.15,1:19:01.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不可能。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.45,1:19:04.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是看到了这些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.95,1:19:08.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚安，教授。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good night, professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.16,1:19:16.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拓宽你们的思维。你们必须看得更远。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Broaden your minds. You must look beyond.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.50,1:19:21.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}水晶球占卜的艺术在于清空内眼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The art of crystal gazing is in the clearing of the Inner Eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.72,1:19:25.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有那样才能看见。再试一次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Only then can you see. Try again.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.97,1:19:28.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，我们看看这是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, what do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.81,1:19:32.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦。你介意我试试吗？  -阿……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh. Do you mind me trying?   -Al....
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.02,1:19:37.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可能是“不祥”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Grim, possibly.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.15,1:19:44.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲爱的，从你踏进我课堂的第一刻起……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My dear, from the first moment you stepped foot in my class...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.40,1:19:48.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我就感觉到你缺乏应有的灵性……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I sensed that you did not possess the proper spirit...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.37,1:19:52.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……来学习高贵的占卜术。不，你看，那里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...for the noble art of Divination. No, you see, there.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.45,1:19:56.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也许年纪轻轻，但你的心却像……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You may be young in years, but your heart is as shriveled...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.29,1:20:00.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……老处女的一样干枯，你的灵魂干枯得像那些书的书页……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...aS an old maid's, your soul as dry as the pages of the books...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.46,1:20:03.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你却死死抓着那些书不放。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...to which you so desperately cleave.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.11,1:20:21.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说错什么了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have I said something?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.78,1:20:30.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赫敏疯了。倒不是说她以前不疯……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's gone mental, Hermione has. Not that she wasn't always mental...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.95,1:20:33.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……但现在大家都看出来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but now it's in the open for everyone to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.70,1:20:35.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.08,1:20:38.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我们最好把这还回去。  -我不回去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We better take this back.   -I'm not going back.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.29,1:20:42.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好吧。回头见。  -再见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Fine. See you later.   -See you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.46,1:21:25.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利·波特……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry Potter....
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.64,1:21:36.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-特里劳妮教授——他今晚会回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Professor Trelawney-- He will return tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.06,1:21:38.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.89,1:21:43.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚，那个背叛朋友、心被谋杀腐蚀的人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tonight, he who betrayed his friends, whose heart rots with murder...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.69,1:21:45.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……将挣脱束缚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...shall break free.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.90,1:21:48.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}无辜者的血将被洒下……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Innocent blood shall be spilt...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.32,1:21:54.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……仆人与主人将再次团聚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and servant and master shall be reunited once more.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.71,1:22:03.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，真抱歉，亲爱的孩子。你刚才说什么了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I'm so sorry, dear boy. Did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.71,1:22:06.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.96,1:22:08.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.10,1:23:05.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不敢相信他们要杀掉巴克比克。太可怕了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't believe they're going to kill Buckbeak. It's just too horrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.31,1:23:08.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-更糟的还在后头。我怎么说的？父亲说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It just got worse. What did I say? Father said...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.23,1:23:12.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我可以留下那头鹰头马身有翼兽的脑袋。我要把它捐给格兰芬多休息室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I can keep the hippogriff's head. I'll donate it to the Gryffindors' room.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.57,1:23:15.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这下可有好戏看了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is going to be rich.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.24,1:23:17.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看谁来了。 -来看热闹吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Look who's here.   -Come to see the show?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.58,1:23:20.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你！你这个肮脏、恶心、邪恶的小蟑螂！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You! You foul, loathsome, evil little cockroach!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.87,1:23:22.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赫敏，别！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hermione, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.21,1:23:25.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不值得你动手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.26,1:23:41.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦！马尔福，你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh! Malfoy, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.81,1:23:46.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我们走。快。别跟任何人说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Let's go. Quick. Not a word to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.19,1:23:50.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-感觉真好。  -不是好，是太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That felt good.   -Not good, brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.04,1:24:14.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看他。喜欢风吹过树林时的气味。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at him. Loves the smell of the trees when the wind blows through them.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.51,1:24:16.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们为什么不干脆放了他？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't we just set him free?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.97,1:24:19.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们会知道是我放的，然后邓布利多……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They'd know it was me, and then Dumbledore...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.56,1:24:22.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……会有麻烦。他下来了，邓布利多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...would get into trouble. He's coming down, Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.72,1:24:25.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说他们……的时候，他想陪着我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Says he wants to be with me when they....
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.10,1:24:28.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等事情发生的时候。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When it happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.31,1:24:29.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}邓布利多是个伟人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great man, Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.65,1:24:31.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个伟人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A great man.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.65,1:24:37.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我们也会陪着你。  -绝对不行！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We'll stay with you too.   -You'll do no such thing!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.82,1:24:40.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为我想让你看到那种场面吗？不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Think I want you seeing something like that? No.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.16,1:24:44.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们喝完茶就走吧。哦，走之前，罗恩……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just drink your tea and be off. Oh. Before you do, Ron....
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.25,1:24:54.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斑斑！你还活着！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Scabbers! You're alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.80,1:24:58.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-看好你的宠物。  -我觉得你该向某人道歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Keep a closer eye on your pet.   -I think you owe someone an apology.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.68,1:25:02.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。下次见到克鲁克山，我会告诉它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. Next time I see Crookshanks, I'll let him know.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.60,1:25:03.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说我！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I meant me!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.39,1:25:06.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。那是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Blimey. What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.56,1:25:12.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎哟！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.07,1:25:14.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海格！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hagrid!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.40,1:25:17.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, crikey.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.20,1:25:21.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，部长。这边走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, minister. Over this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.16,1:25:26.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很晚了。天快黑了。你们不该在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's late. It's nearly dark. You shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.41,1:25:30.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这么晚还在外面，被人看见你们就麻烦了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Someone sees you outside this time of night, you'll be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.38,1:25:33.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尤其是你，哈利。马上就来陪你！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Particularly you, Harry. With you in a moment!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.38,1:25:37.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快。快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quick. Quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.97,1:25:39.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海格。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.88,1:25:43.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-会没事的。会好的。  -快走，快走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It'll be fine. It'll be okay.   -Go on, go on!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.64,1:25:48.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看到那边——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's ling you see there--
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.60,1:25:51.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-在山坡上——啊，海格。邓布利多教授。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-On the slope-- Ah, Hagrid. Professor Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.44,1:25:54.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚上好。请进吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good evening. Make your way through.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.36,1:25:58.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-想喝茶就喝吧。不用了，海格。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Have a tea, if you like. No, Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.28,1:26:02.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生们。我想来杯茶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gentlemen. I'd like a cup of tea.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.08,1:26:06.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，我想我们该办正事了，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I think we should get down to our business, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.58,1:26:11.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。根据危险生物处置委员会的决定……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very well. It is the decision of the Committee for the Disposal...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.33,1:26:14.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……鹰头马身有翼兽巴克比克……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...of Dangerous Creatures that the hippogriff Buckbeak...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.67,1:26:20.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……以下简称“死刑犯”，将于今日日落时处决。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...hereinafter called "the condemned," shall be executed this day at sundown.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.34,1:26:23.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎呀，哎呀……海格。好了，别这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dear, dear.... Hagrid. Now, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.10,1:26:25.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。会没事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. It'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.93,1:26:29.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}处决将执行——什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The execution shall dispatch-- What?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.56,1:26:32.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为我刚才看到——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought I just saw--
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.81,1:26:34.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-算了。  -我们走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Never mind.   -Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.03,1:26:42.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}巴克比克没有恶意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Buckbeak didn't mean no harm.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.87,1:27:30.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.26,1:27:43.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他咬了我。斑斑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He bit me. Scabbers.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.05,1:27:46.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗恩。罗恩！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ron. Ron!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.97,1:27:50.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗恩！斑斑，回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ron! Scabbers, come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.02,1:27:53.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.69,1:28:03.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斑斑，你咬我！——哈利，你知道这是什么树吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Scabbers, you bit me!   -Harry, you do realize what tree this is?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.15,1:28:06.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这下糟了。罗恩，快跑！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not good. Ron, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.58,1:28:11.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利，赫敏，快跑！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry, Hermione, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.70,1:28:14.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是阴尸犬！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's the Grim!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.30,1:28:23.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-啊！哈利！  -罗恩！罗恩，等等！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Ah! Harry!   -Ron! Ron, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.96,1:28:26.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-罗恩！  -哈利！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Ron!   -Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.18,1:28:30.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-救命！罗恩！-\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Help! Ron!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.81,1:28:32.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.68,1:28:35.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗恩。罗恩。罗恩！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ron. Ron. Ron!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.78,1:28:52.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.70,1:28:56.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}动起来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.17,1:29:01.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}低头！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Duck!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.79,1:29:40.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.97,1:29:58.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，对不起。-别担心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, I'm sorry.   -Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.14,1:30:03.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你觉得这通向哪儿？  -我有种预感。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Where do you suppose this goes?   -I have a hunch.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.61,1:30:05.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只希望我猜错了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just hope I'm wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.79,1:30:27.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们在尖叫棚屋，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're in the Shrieking Shack, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.05,1:30:30.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.02,1:30:42.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ron.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.98,1:30:45.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗恩。你没事。-那条狗。它在哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Ron. You're okay.   -The dog. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.82,1:30:49.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是个陷阱。他就是那条狗。他是个阿尼马格斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a trap. He's the dog. He's an Animagus.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.92,1:31:05.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你想杀哈利，就得把我们也杀了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you want to kill Harry, you have to kill us too!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.58,1:31:07.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。今晚只有一个人会死。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Only one will die tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.88,1:31:09.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就死你！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then it'll be you!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.01,1:31:18.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要杀我吗，哈利？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you going to kill me, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.39,1:31:21.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-除你武器！啊！-\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Expelliarmus! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.94,1:31:29.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎呀呀，西里斯。瞧你这副狼狈样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, well, Sirius. Looking rather ragged, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.32,1:31:32.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总算，这副皮囊映出了内心的疯狂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Finally, the flesh reflects the madness within.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.95,1:31:36.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你倒是最懂内心的疯狂，不是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you'd know all about the madness within, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.00,1:31:48.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我找到他了。我知道。-\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I found him. I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.38,1:31:49.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-就是他。  -我明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's him.   -I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.67,1:31:52.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-杀了他！  -不！我那么信任你！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Let's kill him!   -No! I trusted you!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.30,1:31:57.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而一直以来，你都是他的朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And all this time, you've been his friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.76,1:32:00.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是狼人！怪不得他总缺课。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's a werewolf! That's why he's been missing classes.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.60,1:32:05.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道多久了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How long have you known?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.81,1:32:09.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-从斯内普教授布置论文起。赫敏，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Since Professor Snape set the essay. Well, Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.23,1:32:11.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是我见过你这个年纪最聪明的女巫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are the brightest witch of your age I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.90,1:32:14.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别废话了，莱姆斯！来吧，杀了他！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Enough talk, Remus! Come on, let's kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.95,1:32:17.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-等等！  -我等了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Wait!   -I did my waiting!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.74,1:32:20.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等了十二年！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Twelve years of it!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.78,1:32:23.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在阿兹卡班！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In Azkaban!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.63,1:32:34.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。杀了他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very well. Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.97,1:32:38.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但再等一分钟。哈利有权知道原因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But wait one more minute. Harry has the right to know why.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.89,1:32:40.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道原因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Know why.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.68,1:32:42.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你背叛了我父母。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You betrayed my parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.10,1:32:46.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他们的死都是你害的！  -不，不是他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You're the reason they're dead!   -No, it wasn't him.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.19,1:32:48.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}确实有人背叛了你父母……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Somebody did betray your parents...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.27,1:32:51.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……一个直到最近我还以为已经死了的人！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... somebody who, until quite recently, I believed to be dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.98,1:32:55.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那是谁？  -小矮星彼得！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Who was it, then?   -Peter Pettigrew!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.61,1:32:58.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他就在这屋里！就在现在！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And he's in this room! Right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.24,1:33:02.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出来，出来吧，彼得！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come out, come out, Peter!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.37,1:33:05.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-出来，出来玩啊！  -除你武器！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come out, come out and play!   -Expelliarmus!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.33,1:33:10.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}复仇的滋味真甜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Vengeance is sweet.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.00,1:33:13.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我多希望是我亲手抓住你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How I hoped I'd be the one to catch you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.42,1:33:14.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}西弗勒斯——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Severus--
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.92,1:33:19.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我告诉过邓布利多你在帮一个朋友混进城堡。证据就在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told Dumbledore you were helping a friend into the castle. Here's the proof.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.84,1:33:21.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真有你的，斯内普。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Brilliant, Snape.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.35,1:33:25.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你费尽心思，结论却完全错了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've put your keen mind to the task and come to the wrong conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.93,1:33:28.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请见谅，莱姆斯和我还有事……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you'll excuse us, Remus and I have business...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.77,1:33:33.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-……要处理。  -给我个理由。求你了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-...to attend to.   -Give me a reason. I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.94,1:33:36.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-别犯傻。  -他改不了，习惯了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Don't be a fool.   -He can't help it. It's habit.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.74,1:33:38.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-闭嘴。  -你才闭嘴！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Be quiet.   -Be quiet yourself!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.49,1:33:40.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们俩，吵得像老夫老妻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You two, quarrelling like an old married couple.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.07,1:33:43.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走开吧，去玩你的化学套装！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Run along and play with your chemistry set!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.16,1:33:46.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我本可以动手的，你知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I could do it, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.12,1:33:52.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但何必拦着摄魂怪呢？它们可太想见你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But why deny the dementors? They're so longing to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.92,1:33:55.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是不是察觉到一丝恐惧？哦，是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do I detect a flicker of fear? Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.80,1:33:59.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}摄魂怪的吻。真难以想象那是什么滋味。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A Dementor's Kiss. One can only imagine what that must be like.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.47,1:34:04.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}据说目睹它几乎无法忍受，但我会尽力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's said to be nearly unbearable to witness, but I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.10,1:34:07.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}西弗勒斯，求你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Severus, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.39,1:34:10.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你先请。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.82,1:34:16.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除你武器！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Expelliarmus!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.32,1:34:21.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哈利！你干了什么？  -你袭击了老师！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Harry! What did you just do?   -You attacked a teacher!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.12,1:34:24.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-告诉我彼得的事。  -他和我们上同一所学校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Tell me about Peter.   -He was at school with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.87,1:34:26.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们以为他是朋友！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We thought he was our friend!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.70,1:34:29.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不。彼得死了。是你杀了他！  -不，他没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No. Pettigrew's dead. You killed him!   -No, he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.87,1:34:33.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我本来也这么想，直到你在活点地图上提到彼得！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought so too, until you mentioned Pettigrew on the map!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.29,1:34:36.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那地图在撒谎。  -地图从不撒谎！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-The map was lying, then.   -The map never lies!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.25,1:34:40.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}彼得还活着！他就在那儿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pettigrew's alive! And he's right there!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.72,1:34:45.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我？！他疯了！  -不是你！是你的老鼠！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Me?! He's mental!   -Not you! Your rat!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.60,1:34:48.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-斑斑在我家养了——-十二年？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Scabbers has been in my family for-- -Twelve years?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.89,1:34:51.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一只普通家鼠能活这么久可真是奇怪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Curiously long life for a common garden rat!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.56,1:34:54.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他缺了根脚趾，对吧？那又怎样？-\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He's missing a toe, isn't he? So what?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.31,1:34:57.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他们找到彼得的只有他的——手指！-\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-All they could find of Pettigrew was his-- Finger!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.48,1:35:00.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那卑鄙的懦夫自己切掉，好让所有人以为他死了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dirty coward cut it off so everyone would think he was dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.90,1:35:03.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-然后他就变成老鼠！  -给我看看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-And then he transformed into a rat!   -Show me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.53,1:35:09.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-给他，罗恩。  -你想对他做什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Give it to him, Ron.   -What are you trying to do to him?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.79,1:35:10.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斑斑！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Scabbers!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.04,1:35:14.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放开他！下去！你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Leave him alone! Get off him! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.09,1:35:24.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.61,1:35:38.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}莱姆斯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Remus?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.19,1:35:40.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}西里斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.86,1:35:42.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的老朋友！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My old friends!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.41,1:35:52.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利！看看你。你长得真像你父亲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry! Look at you. You look so much like your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.41,1:35:56.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-詹姆。我们曾是最好的朋友——-你竟敢跟哈利说话！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-James. We were the best of friends-- -How dare you speak to Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.92,1:35:59.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你竟敢在他面前提詹姆！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How dare you talk about James in front of him!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.75,1:36:04.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你把詹姆和莉莉出卖给了伏地魔！  -我不是故意的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You sold James and Lily to Voldemort!   -I didn't mean to!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.13,1:36:07.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}黑魔王。你根本不知道他拥有什么武器！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Dark Lord. You have no idea the weapons he possesses!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.18,1:36:10.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}扪心自问，西里斯！换了你你会怎么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ask yourself, Sirius! What would you have done?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.18,1:36:16.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你会怎么做？  -我宁可死，也不背叛朋友！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What would you have done?   -Died, rather than betray my friends!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.94,1:36:21.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}詹姆不会想让我被杀死的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}James wouldn't have wanted me killed!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.53,1:36:27.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你爸爸会饶我一命的！他会对我手下留情的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your dad would have spared me! He would have shown me mercy!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.70,1:36:31.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我早该想到，伏地魔没杀你，我们也会杀了你。一起上！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Should have realized if Voldemort didn't kill you, we would. Together!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.08,1:36:34.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.62,1:36:39.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哈利，这个人—— -我知道他是什么货色。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Harry, this man-- -I know what he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.75,1:36:41.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们会把他押到城堡去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But we'll take him to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.84,1:36:46.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-祝福你，孩子。祝福你！  -滚开！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Bless you, boy. Bless you!   -Get off!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.05,1:36:50.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说了，我们会把你押到城堡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I said we'd take you to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.80,1:36:53.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那之后，摄魂怪就归它们了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After that, the dementors can have you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.94,1:37:00.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉咬了你。我猜有点疼吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry about the bite. I reckon that twinges a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.86,1:37:04.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有点？有点？你差点把我的腿扯下来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A bit? A bit? You almost tore my leg off!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.57,1:37:06.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是冲着那只老鼠去的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was going for the rat.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.28,1:37:10.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}平常我变成狗的时候，脾气是很温顺的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Normally, I have a very sweet disposition as a dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.28,1:37:15.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}詹姆不止一次建议我干脆永远变成狗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}More than once, James suggested that I make the change permanent.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.70,1:37:20.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尾巴我还能忍。可跳蚤真是要命。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The tail I could live with. But the fleas, they're murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.92,1:37:29.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.14,1:37:34.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.64,1:37:42.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你最好走吧。不。别担心，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You better go. No. Don't worry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.36,1:37:43.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事。我留下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's fine. I'll stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.52,1:37:46.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你走，我留下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You go, I'll stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.82,1:37:49.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧？-我没事。去吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You okay?   -I'm fine. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.53,1:37:54.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看着真疼。-疼死了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That looks really painful.   -So painful.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.70,1:37:57.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们可能会把它锯掉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They might chop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.75,1:38:00.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}庞弗雷夫人肯定一下子就能治好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sure Madam Pomfrey will fix it in a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.58,1:38:04.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太迟了。已经废了。只能锯掉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's too late. It's ruined. It'll have to be chopped off.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.05,1:38:07.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真美，不是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's beautiful, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.72,1:38:12.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我永远忘不了第一次走进那些大门的情景。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll never forget the first time I walked through those doors.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.18,1:38:16.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能以自由人的身份再走一次，那感觉一定很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'll be nice to do it again as a free man.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.48,1:38:21.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你刚才做的是件高尚的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was a noble thing you did back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.10,1:38:24.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不配。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He doesn't deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.44,1:38:27.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得我爸不会希望他最好的朋友……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't think my dad would have wanted his best friends...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.28,1:38:28.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……变成杀人犯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...to become killers.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.49,1:38:33.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再说，他一死，真相也就跟他一起没了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Besides, dead, the truth dies with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.37,1:38:35.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他活着，你才能洗清冤屈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Alive, you're free.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.91,1:38:39.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把我变成弗洛伯毛虫都行。只要别交给摄魂怪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turn me into a flobberworm. Anything but the dementors!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.20,1:38:42.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗恩！我一直是只乖宠物吧？你不会让他们把我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ron! Haven't I been a good pet? You won't let them give me...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.71,1:38:45.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……交给摄魂怪吧？我可是你的老鼠啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...to the dementors, will you? I was your rat!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.38,1:38:49.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-甜美聪明的姑娘！你肯定不会——离她远点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Sweet, clever girl! Surely you won't-- Get away from her!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.88,1:38:53.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道你知不知道，哈利……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know if you know, Harry...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.97,1:38:58.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……但你出生时，詹姆和莉莉让我做了你的教父。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but when you were born, James and Lily made me your godfather.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.22,1:39:00.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.35,1:39:05.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你选择跟姨妈姨父一起住，我能理解……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can understand if you choose to stay with your aunt and uncle...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.56,1:39:08.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……但如果你想要另一个家……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but if you ever wanted a different home....
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.23,1:39:10.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？跟你一起住？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? Come and live with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.03,1:39:15.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是个想法。你不想的话我能理解。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just a thought. I can understand if you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.41,1:39:16.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.38,1:39:35.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}莱姆斯，我的老朋友。你今晚喝药了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Remus, my old friend. Have you taken your potion tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.39,1:39:42.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道自己真正是谁，莱姆斯！你的真心在这里！这里！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know the man you truly are, Remus! This heart is where you truly live! Here!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.06,1:39:46.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这肉身不过是肉身！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This flesh is only flesh!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.23,1:39:49.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除你武器！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Expelliarmus!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.41,1:40:00.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.04,1:40:05.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}莱姆斯！莱姆斯！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Remus! Remus!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.21,1:40:13.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快跑！快跑！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.60,1:40:25.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。-等等。等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come on.   -Wait. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.77,1:40:30.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赫敏！馊主意。馊主意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hermione! Bad idea. Bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.02,1:40:33.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}教授？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Professor?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.36,1:40:38.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卢平教授？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Professor Lupin?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.67,1:40:49.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乖狗狗。乖狗狗！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice doggy. Nice doggy!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.34,1:40:52.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在这儿，波特！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There you are, Potter!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.66,1:41:27.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小天狼星！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sirius!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.54,1:41:30.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回来，波特！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come back here, Potter!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.78,1:42:38.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小天狼星！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sirius!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.99,1:42:41.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。小天狼星！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Sirius!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.82,1:43:26.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼神护卫！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Expecto Patronum!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.75,1:45:41.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.80,1:45:45.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看见我爸了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw my dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.38,1:45:46.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.13,1:45:48.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他把摄魂怪赶走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He sent the dementors away.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.84,1:45:50.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在湖对岸看见他了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw him across the lake.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.43,1:45:52.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利，他们抓住了小天狼星。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry, they've captured Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.30,1:45:55.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}摄魂怪随时会施行那个吻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Any minute the dementors are gonna perform the Kiss.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.31,1:45:57.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他们要杀了他？  -不。更糟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-They're gonna kill him?   -No. It's worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.02,1:45:59.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}糟得多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Much worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.02,1:46:02.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它们要吸走他的灵魂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're going to suck out his soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.11,1:46:05.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}校长，快阻止他们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Headmaster, stop them.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.65,1:46:09.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他们抓错人了。  -是真的。小天狼星是无辜的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-They've got the wrong man.   -It's true. Sirius is innocent.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.20,1:46:11.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是斑斑干的。  -斑斑？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's Scabbers who did it.   -Scabbers?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.57,1:46:12.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是我的老鼠，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's my rat, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.37,1:46:17.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他其实不是老鼠。他曾经是只老鼠。是我哥哥珀西的老鼠。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's not really a rat. He was a rat. He was my brother Percy's rat.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.37,1:46:21.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-可后来他们给了他一只猫头鹰——-重点是，我们知道真相。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-But then they gave him an owl-- -The point is, we know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.25,1:46:23.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-请相信我们。  -我相信，格兰杰小姐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Please believe us.   -I do, Miss Granger.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.96,1:46:29.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但三个十三岁巫师的话，说服不了多少人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But the word of three 13-year-old wizards will convince few others.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.47,1:46:35.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}孩子的声音，无论多么真诚……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A child's voice, however honest and true...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.43,1:46:39.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……对那些忘了如何倾听的人，都毫无意义。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...S meaningless to those who have forgotten how to listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.40,1:46:46.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}时间，真是神秘的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mysterious thing, time.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.11,1:46:49.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}强大……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Powerful...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.61,1:46:52.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……而一旦被干预，就很危险。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..and when meddled with, dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.07,1:46:57.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小天狼星·布莱克被关在黑塔最高层的牢房里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sirius Black is in the topmost cell of the Dark Tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.50,1:47:00.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你懂规矩，格兰杰小姐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know the laws, Miss Granger.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.79,1:47:02.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}绝不能被看见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You must not be seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.75,1:47:06.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得，你们最好在最后一声钟响前回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you would do well, I feel, to return before this last chime.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.59,1:47:10.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}否则后果不堪设想，我都不愿多说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If not, the consequences are too ghastly to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.67,1:47:12.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果今晚你们成功了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you succeed tonight...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.64,1:47:15.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……可救下的不止一条无辜的性命。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...more than one innocent life may be spared.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.31,1:47:19.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想，转三圈就够了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Three turns should do it, I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.40,1:47:26.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，顺便说一句。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, and by the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.40,1:47:32.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿不准的时候，我发现从原路回溯开始是个明智的选择。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When in doubt, I find retracing my steps to be a wise place to begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.40,1:47:34.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}祝你们好运。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.99,1:47:37.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这到底是怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the bloody hell was that all about?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.12,1:47:40.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，罗恩，可既然你走不了路……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry, Ron, but seeing as you can't walk....
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.44,1:48:11.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刚才发生什么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.24,1:48:13.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}——罗恩在哪儿？七点半方向。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Where's Ron? 7:30.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.70,1:48:15.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}七点半的时候我们在哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where were we at 7:30?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.74,1:48:17.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道。去海格那儿了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. Going to Hagrid's?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.70,1:48:20.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走。不能被人看见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. And we can't be seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.16,1:48:23.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赫敏！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hermione!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.18,1:48:43.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赫敏！赫敏，等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hermione! Hermione, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.64,1:48:47.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能不能告诉我，我们到底在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you please tell me what it is we're doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.02,1:48:49.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来看好戏吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come to see the show?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.44,1:48:52.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这肮脏、恶心、邪恶的小蟑螂！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You foul, loathsome, evil little cockroach!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.44,1:48:53.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就是我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's us.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.99,1:48:56.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赫敏，别！他不值得。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hermione, no! He's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.11,1:48:58.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可不正常。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is not normal.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.87,1:49:03.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是时间转换器，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is a Time-Turner, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.41,1:49:05.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}麦格在第一学期给我的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}McGonagall gave it to me first term.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.79,1:49:09.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一整年就是这样赶上每一节课的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is how I've been getting to my lessons all year.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.33,1:49:12.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—你是说我们回到过去了？  -—是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You mean we've gone back in time?   -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.71,1:49:16.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}邓布利多显然想让我们回到这一刻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dumbledore obviously wanted us to return to this moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.38,1:49:21.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}显然发生了某件事，他想让我们去改变。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Clearly, something happened he wants us to change.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.68,1:49:26.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打得好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good punch.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.18,1:49:27.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.69,1:49:30.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马尔福来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Malfoy's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.27,1:49:33.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快跑。跟谁都别提。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Run. Not a word to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.07,1:49:37.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一定要收拾那个自命不凡的泥巴种！你等着瞧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna get that jumped-up mudblood! Mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.32,1:49:41.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那感觉真爽。不是爽，是太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That felt good. Not good, brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.62,1:49:45.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧。我们该去海格那儿了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. We should be at Hagrid's.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.35,1:50:06.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看。巴克比克还活着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look. Buckbeak's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.35,1:50:10.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.40,1:50:12.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还记得邓布利多说的话吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Remember what Dumbledore said?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.56,1:50:16.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我们成功，就能救下不止一条无辜的生命。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If we succeed, more than one innocent life could be spared.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.98,1:50:18.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.59,1:50:41.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们来了。我得快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here they come. I'd better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.88,1:50:44.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在我们偷走巴克比克之前，福吉得先看见它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fudge has to see Buckbeak before we steal him.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.56,1:50:47.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不然他会以为是海格放走了它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Otherwise, he'll think Hagrid set him free.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.06,1:50:50.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斑斑，你还活着！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Scabbers, you're alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.60,1:50:53.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看好你的宠物。——那是小矮星。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Keep a closer eye on your pet.   -That's Pettigrew.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.60,1:50:56.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—哈利，你不能。  -—他背叛了我父母。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Harry, you can't.   -He betrayed my parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.69,1:50:59.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—你不会指望我坐在这儿吧。  -—你得坐，必须坐！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You don't expect me to sit here.   -Yes, and you must!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.57,1:51:06.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利，你现在在海格的小屋里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry, you're in Hagrid's hut now.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.45,1:51:09.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要是冲进去，会以为自己疯了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you go bursting in, you'll think you've gone mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.45,1:51:12.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}插手时间的巫师，会遭遇可怕的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Awful things happen to wizards who meddle with time.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.50,1:51:14.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不能被人看见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We can't be seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.05,1:51:19.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}福吉来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fudge is coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.67,1:51:22.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们还不走？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And we aren't leaving?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.93,1:51:26.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们为什么还不走？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why aren't we leaving?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.44,1:51:38.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你疯了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you mad?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.11,1:51:43.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎哟！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.86,1:51:46.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎哟，好疼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ow. That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.58,1:51:47.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.04,1:52:04.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看到那边那棵——啊，海格。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's ling you see there-- Ah, Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.76,1:52:11.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们从后门出去。快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're coming out the back door. Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.82,1:52:31.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我头发从后面看真的是这样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that really what my hair looks like from the back?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.70,1:52:35.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.92,1:52:37.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为我刚看到……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought I just saw....
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.96,1:52:40.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}——算了。走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Never mind. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.94,1:52:57.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，走，哈利。快走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, go, Harry. Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.48,1:53:05.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走开。滚开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get away. Get off.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.96,1:53:23.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎哟！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.63,1:53:31.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}部长，我真的觉得我也该签字。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Minister, I really think I should sign as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.89,1:53:35.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，可以。也许这样更……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, very well. Perhaps it would be....
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.27,1:53:39.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，巴克比克。快过来。跟我们来。来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, Buckbeak. Come quickly. Come with us now. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.52,1:53:46.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再试试。快来。快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep trying. Come on. Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.61,1:53:52.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}巴克比克，好吗？快点。快点儿，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Buckbeak. Okay? Quickly. Hurry up. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.24,1:53:56.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只签你的名字。名字太长了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your name only. It's a very long name....
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.91,1:53:58.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点儿，巴克比克，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hurry up now, Buckbeak, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.34,1:54:04.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快来。快来啊，巴克比克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Come on, Buckbeak.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.50,1:54:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吃这只美味的死雪貂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come and get the nice dead ferret.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.43,1:54:13.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—快来。就在这儿。来啊，小比克。  -—这边，部长。跟我来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come on. It's here. Come on, Beaky. Here, minister. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.14,1:54:15.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—看那边。  -—哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Now, look there. Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.02,1:54:19.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看石头那边。——我该看到什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look beyond the rocks. What am I supposed to see?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.56,1:54:23.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是迪佩特教授当校长时种下的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Professor Dippet had that ling planted when he was headmaster.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.23,1:54:26.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—哦，对。没错，没错。  -—还有那些草莓。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, yes. Indeed, indeed.   -And all the strawberries.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.03,1:54:29.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—来吧，巴克比克。来啊。  -—我可没看见什么草莓。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come on, Buckbeak. Come on. I see no strawberries.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.82,1:54:31.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那儿。——哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There. Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.41,1:54:33.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那儿。这边走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There. This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.37,1:54:36.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们快点把这事办完吧。——好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's get this over, please. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.70,1:54:39.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可它去哪儿了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.33,1:54:42.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刚才还看见那头野兽。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw the beast, just now.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.17,1:54:45.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}——就在刚才！真奇怪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Not a moment ago! How extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.54,1:54:46.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}巴克比克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Buckbeak.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.09,1:54:51.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得了吧，邓布利多。显然是有人把它放了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come now, Dumbledore. Someone's obviously released him.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.34,1:54:52.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—海格？  -—巴克比克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hagrid?   -Buckbeak.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.89,1:54:57.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想他并不是在说这事与你有关。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think he suggests you had anything to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.35,1:55:00.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么可能？你一直跟我们在一起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How could you? You've been with us all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.35,1:55:02.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错。——好了，好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Right.   -Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.40,1:55:03.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们必须搜查这一带。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We must search the grounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.11,1:55:07.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就搜天上吧，部长，如果你非搜不可。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, search the skies, if you must, minister.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.32,1:55:12.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这期间，我想喝杯好茶，或者来一大杯白兰地。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Meanwhile, I'd like a nice cup of tea or a large brandy.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.91,1:55:16.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，刽子手，用不着你效劳了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, executioner, your services are no longer required.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.08,1:55:18.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.16,1:55:22.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这屋里可找不到小杯子，教授。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll find no small glasses in this house, professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.18,1:55:34.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧。这边。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.52,1:55:43.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这边，快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This way, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.73,1:55:47.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—现在怎么办？  -—我们去救小天狼星。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Now what?   -We save Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.69,1:55:50.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么救？——不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-How?   -No idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.49,1:56:01.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—看。是卢平。  -—统统石化！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Look. It's Lupin. lmmobulus!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.30,1:56:10.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斯内普也来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And Snape's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.51,1:56:18.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我们等着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And now we wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.39,1:56:21.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我们等着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And now we wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.66,1:56:44.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.75,1:56:50.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少有人玩得开心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At least someone's enjoying himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.96,1:56:52.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.80,1:56:56.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-赫敏？  -嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hermione?   -Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.76,1:57:01.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刚才在湖边，我和小天狼星在一起的时候……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Before, down by the lake, when I was with Sirius...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.26,1:57:03.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我真的看到了一个人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I did see someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.56,1:57:06.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个人把摄魂怪赶走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That someone made the dementors go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.14,1:57:08.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用守护神咒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With a Patronus.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.65,1:57:10.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听见斯内普跟邓布利多说的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I heard Snape telling Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.73,1:57:12.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}据他说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}According to him...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.36,1:57:15.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……只有非常强大的巫师才能施出那个咒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...only a really powerful wizard could have conjured it.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.95,1:57:17.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我爸爸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was my dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.95,1:57:20.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我爸爸施的守护神咒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My dad conjured the Patronus.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.91,1:57:23.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哈利，可你爸爸已经—— -死了。我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Harry, but your dad's-- -Dead. I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.58,1:57:26.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是把看到的告诉你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just telling you what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.04,1:57:32.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here we come.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.30,1:57:40.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看得见小天狼星在跟我说话吗？嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see Sirius talking to me? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.89,1:57:43.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他让我跟他一起住。-太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He's asking me to live with him.   -That's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.89,1:57:47.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等我们救出他，我就再也不用回德思礼家了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When we free him, I'll never have to go back to the Dursleys'.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.39,1:57:49.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就我和他两个人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'll just be me and him.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.69,1:57:51.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们可以住在乡下……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We could live in the country...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.82,1:57:54.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……一个能看到天空的地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...someplace you can see the sky.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.61,1:57:57.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在阿兹卡班待了那么多年，他会喜欢的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He'll like that after all those years in Azkaban.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.49,1:57:59.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.58,1:58:03.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快跑！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.17,1:58:11.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.27,1:58:33.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你在干什么？  -救你的命。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What are you doing?   -Saving your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.86,1:58:39.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.07,1:58:45.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好极了。现在他冲我们来了。  -是啊，我没考虑到这个。快跑！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Great. Now he's coming for us.   -Yeah, I didn't think about that. Run!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.24,2:00:01.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刚才太吓人了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was So scary.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.15,2:00:05.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可怜的卢平教授今晚真够受的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Poor Professor Lupin's having a really tough night.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.54,2:00:19.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小天狼星。快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sirius. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.69,2:00:37.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-太可怕了。  -别担心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-This is horrible.   -Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:37.98,2:00:41.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸爸会来的。他会施守护神咒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My dad will come. He'll conjure the Patronus.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.91,2:00:51.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}随时都会来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.95,2:00:54.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在那儿。你会看到的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right there. You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.37,2:00:57.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利，听我说。没有人会来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry, listen to me. No one's coming.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.04,2:01:00.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心，他会来的。他会来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry, he will. He will come.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.72,2:01:07.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小天狼星。你快死了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sirius. You're dying...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.22,2:01:11.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你们两个都是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...both of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.18,2:01:14.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.81,2:01:20.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼神护卫！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Expecto Patronum!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:19.29,2:02:20.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说得对，赫敏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You were right, Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.04,2:02:24.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刚才看到的不是我爸爸。是我自己！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It wasn't my dad I saw earlier. It was me!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.55,2:02:27.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看到的是我自己在施守护神咒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw myself conjuring the Patronus before.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.46,2:02:29.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道这次我能做到，因为……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Knew I could do it this time because...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.01,2:02:31.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……因为我之前已经做过了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...well, I had already done it.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.89,2:02:34.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这说得通吗？  -说不通。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Does that make sense?   -No.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.51,2:02:35.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我不喜欢飞行……！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I don't like flying...!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.49,2:02:51.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爆破咒！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bombarda!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.15,2:03:27.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会永远感激这件事……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be forever grateful for this...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:28.11,2:03:29.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……感谢你们两个人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...to both of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.61,2:03:32.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我想跟你走。  -也许有一天吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I want to go with you.   -One day, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.70,2:03:35.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有一阵子，我的生活会太难以预料。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For some time, my life will be too unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.78,2:03:37.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And besides...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.45,2:03:41.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-……你注定要留在这里。  -可你是无辜的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-...you're meant to be here.   -But you're innocent.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:41.92,2:03:44.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you know it.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.13,2:03:47.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}目前，这就够了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And for now, that will do.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.34,2:03:51.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜你听这话听腻了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I expect you're tired of hearing this...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.88,2:03:55.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……但你长得太像你父亲了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but you look so like your father.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.18,2:03:59.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除了你的眼睛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Except your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.10,2:04:02.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你有—— -我妈妈的眼睛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You have-- -My mother's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.35,2:04:09.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真残忍，我和詹姆、莉莉相处了那么久，和你却那么少。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's cruel that I spent so much time with James and Lily, and you so little.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:10.03,2:04:11.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你要知道：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But know this:
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.65,2:04:15.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱我们的人永远不会真正离开我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The ones that love us never really leave us.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.20,2:04:19.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你总能找到他们……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you can always find them...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.54,2:04:23.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……就在这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...IN here.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:33.80,2:04:36.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真是你这一代最聪明的女巫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You really are the brightest witch of your age.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:03.16,2:05:04.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.07,2:05:35.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-怎么样？  -他自由了。我们成功了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Well?   -He's free. We did it.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:35.90,2:05:37.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}成功什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did what?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.61,2:05:39.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚安。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:48.33,2:05:49.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么到那儿的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How did you get there?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.83,2:05:52.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刚才在那儿跟你说话。现在你又在那儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was talking to you there. And now you're there.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.84,2:05:55.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他在说什么，哈利？  -我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What's he talking about, Harry?   -I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.63,2:05:59.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说真的，罗恩。一个人怎么可能同时出现在两个地方？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honestly, Ron. How can somebody be in two places at once?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:25.66,2:06:27.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:30.79,2:06:32.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看见你来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw you coming.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.17,2:06:39.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我样子更糟的时候都有过，相信我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've looked worse, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.60,2:06:45.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你被解雇了。  -不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You've been sacked.   -No.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.93,2:06:48.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。其实是我辞职了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. I resigned, actually.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.06,2:06:50.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}辞职？为什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Resigned? Why?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.02,2:06:56.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来有人泄露了我的状况。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, it seems that somebody let slip the nature of my condition.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:56.48,2:07:01.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明天这个时候，猫头鹰就会开始飞来，家长们不会愿意……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This time tomorrow, the owls will start arriving and parents will not want...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:02.16,2:07:05.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……让像我这样的人教他们的孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...well, someone like me teaching their children.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.74,2:07:07.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-可是邓布利多—— -他已经……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-But Dumbledore-- -He has already...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.83,2:07:09.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……为我冒了太多风险。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...fisked enough on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:09.87,2:07:13.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再说，像我这样的人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Besides, people like me are....
Dialogue: 0,2:07:13.75,2:07:17.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这么说吧，我已经习惯了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, let's just say that I'm used to it by now.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:26.64,2:07:29.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么这么沮丧，哈利？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why do you look so miserable, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:29.39,2:07:31.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这一切都没用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}None of it made any difference.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.73,2:07:35.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-小矮星跑了。  -没用？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Pettigrew escaped.   -Didn't make any difference?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:35.44,2:07:38.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这完全不一样了。你揭开了真相。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It made all the difference in the world. You uncovered the truth.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.11,2:07:41.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你救了一个无辜的人，让他免于悲惨的命运。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You saved an innocent man from a terrible fate.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:41.99,2:07:44.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这意义重大。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It made a great deal of difference.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.12,2:07:51.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果说我为什么感到骄傲……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I am proud of anything...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:51.50,2:07:54.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……那就是你这一年学到了多少。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...it is of how much you have learned this year.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.33,2:07:57.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}既然我不再是你的老师了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, since I am no longer your teacher...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.25,2:08:01.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……把这个还给你，我一点也不觉得内疚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...1 feel no guilt whatsoever about giving this back to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:02.42,2:08:04.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，再见了，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So now I'll say goodbye, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.09,2:08:07.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我相信我们还会再见面的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I feel sure we'll meet again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.22,2:08:09.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在那之前……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Until then...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.89,2:08:12.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……恶作剧完毕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...mischief managed.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.84,2:08:51.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后，我说了！你再不安分，我就把它拿上楼去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stand back, I said! Or I'll take it upstairs if you don't settle.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.22,2:08:52.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:53.48,2:08:54.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底是从哪儿弄来的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wherever did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:55.02,2:08:57.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能试试吗，哈利？当然，等你先玩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I have a go, Harry? After you, of course.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:57.60,2:08:59.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在说什么？—安静。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What are you talking about?   -Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:59.94,2:09:03.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让这位先生过去。我不是有意打开的，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let the man through. I didn't mean to open it, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:03.40,2:09:05.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}包装太松了。是他们逼我干的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was badly wrapped. They made me do it.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.07,2:09:07.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}才没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did not.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:08.95,2:09:12.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是火弩箭。世界上最快的扫帚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a Firebolt. It's the fastest broom in the world.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.62,2:09:14.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For me?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:14.33,2:09:16.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-可这是谁送的？  -没人知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-But who sent it?   -No one knows.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.04,2:09:18.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是跟它一起送来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This came with it.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.80,2:09:25.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去吧！让我们看看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go! Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.63,2:09:27.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它有多快，哈利？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How fast is it, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:47.45,2:09:48.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}荧光闪烁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lumos.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:48.61,2:09:51.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我庄严发誓我不干好事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I solemnly swear that I am up to no good.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:10.21,2:21:12.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恶作剧完毕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mischief managed.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:17.76,2:21:19.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}诺克斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nox.
